<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" ?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:g="http://base.google.com/ns/1.0"><channel><title></title><description></description><language>it_IT</language><ttl>720</ttl><item><title>Consultant Transfer Pricing  | Bologna (Bologna, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transfer Pricing Consultant | Bologna&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. I professionisti dello &lt;strong&gt;Studio Associato&lt;/strong&gt; di KPMG intervengono in tutte le principali aree della fiscalità e del diritto societario offrendo servizi integrati e innovativi.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;In particolare, entrando a far parte del &lt;strong&gt;Tax Department&lt;/strong&gt; di &lt;strong&gt;Bologna&lt;/strong&gt;, contribuirai a supportare i clienti nell&apos;affrontare le sfide legate alle principali aree della fiscalità. Opererai in uno scenario in continua evoluzione, dove normative nazionali e internazionali si intrecciano con le aspettative del mercato e dell’opinione pubblica su temi cruciali come l’etica, la trasparenza e la corporate governance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Strutturare ed eseguire analisi di conformità alla normativa fiscale italiana e alle linee guida OCSE in materia di Transfer Pricing, sotto la supervisione di consulenti più esperti;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Analizzare la catena del valore dei gruppi multinazionali attraverso interviste al management;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Analizzare bilanci e contratti infragruppo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Impostare e supervisionare lo svolgimento di analisi di benchmark;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Redigere la documentazione di transfer pricing sotto la supervisione di consulenti più esperti;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Sviluppare conoscenze teoriche in materia di fiscalità internazionale, anche attraverso attività di ricerca su tematiche specifiche;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Supportare i nostri consulenti più esperti al fine di assistere i nostri clienti nell’ambito di verifiche fiscali e procedure di contenzioso, in materia di transfer pricing .&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Questa è l’opportunità perfetta per te se hai:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:107%;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;2/3 anni di esperienza in materia di Transfer Pricing;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:107%;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Laurea magistrale in discipline economiche o giuridiche;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:107%;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Volontà di intraprendere la pratica professionale come dottore commercialista e/o avvocato;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:107%;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Ottima conoscenza della lingua inglese;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:107%;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Ottima conoscenza del pacchetto Microsoft Office;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:107%;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Ottime capacità relazionali e attitudine al lavoro di squadra;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:107%;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Spiccate capacità organizzative, spirito d’iniziativa e problem solving;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:107%;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Approccio flessibile e dinamico.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Sarà considerato un plus un Master di II livello in Diritto Tributario.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Il tuo futuro con noi – Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:107%;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt; ed &lt;strong&gt;equo&lt;/strong&gt;, che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza la &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:107%;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Un contesto &lt;strong&gt;sfidante e dinamico&lt;/strong&gt; che favorisce la creatività e il lavoro di squadra;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:107%;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere l’equilibrio tra vita professionale e privata;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:107%;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione e sviluppo&lt;/strong&gt; avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:107%;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Un mindset internazionale e &lt;strong&gt;progetti innovativi&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:107%;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Iniziative dedicate al &lt;strong&gt;benessere mentale e fisico&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Insieme per un futuro migliore – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro di squadra, rispetto per ogni individuo, apprendimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità e integrità. Questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che creano un ambiente in cui è possibile condividere idee e conoscenze affinché i nostri professionisti possano &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere. All&apos;interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; – [Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)] – sono sintetizzate tutte le azioni concrete che stiamo portando avanti in materia ambientale, sociale e di governance (ESG).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), come modificato. Per ulteriori informazioni, consulta l’informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Studio Associato è un datore di lavoro che offre pari opportunità.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your role and responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;With its highly qualified tax and legal experts, &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Studio Associato&lt;/strong&gt; provides assistance in all the key tax and corporate law areas, offering innovative, integrated services. Its work teams specialise in both professional field and client sector. With over &lt;strong&gt;600 professionals &lt;/strong&gt;at &lt;strong&gt;12 offices &lt;/strong&gt;in Italy&apos;s largest cities, the KPMG network&apos;s Tax and legal unit is one of the top professional partnerships in the country.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;We are recruiting a professional to join our &lt;strong&gt;Transfer Pricing&lt;/strong&gt; team in &lt;strong&gt;Bologna&lt;/strong&gt;, who will perform international tax analyses to establish the transfer prices of goods, services and financial transactions between companies in the same industrial or financial group, in order to determine the proper tax base in each tax jurisdiction in which the group operates.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, the successful candidate will be tasked with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;• Structure and perform compliance analyses with Italian tax regulations and OECD Transfer Pricing Guidelines under the supervision of senior consultants;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;• Analyze the value chain of multinational groups through interviews with management;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;• Review financial statements and intercompany agreements;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;• Set up and oversee the execution of benchmarking analyses;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;• Draft transfer pricing documentation under the supervision of senior consultants;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;• Develop theoretical knowledge of international taxation, including through research on specific topics;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;• Support senior consultants in assisting clients during tax audits and litigation procedures related to transfer pricing. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;2 to 4 years of experience in Transfer Pricing;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Master’s degree in business (LM-56 and LM-77) or Law (LMG-01);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Qualification to practice as a lawyer or chartered accountant, or willingness to obtain such qualifications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Excellent knowledge of English;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Excellent knowledge of Microsoft Office, especially Excel;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Excellent interpersonal and teamwork skills;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Flexible and dynamic approach.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A post-graduate specialisation in Tax Law would be a definite plus.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;•    An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive &lt;/strong&gt;and equitable &lt;strong&gt;work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;•    A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages &lt;strong&gt;creativity &lt;/strong&gt;and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;•    &lt;strong&gt;Hybrid &lt;/strong&gt;work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;•    Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training &lt;/strong&gt;and development programmes to stay current.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;•    &lt;strong&gt;International mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and&lt;strong&gt; innovative projects&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;•    Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG values&lt;/strong&gt; that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - you will find summarised all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social and governance (ESG) issues.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Studio Associato is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-MS1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Bologna-Consultant-Transfer-Pricing-Bologna/1329112157/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1329112157</guid><g:id>1329112157</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Tax</g:job_function><g:location>Bologna, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior - Credit Risk Modelling| Milan (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:center;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:20.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Junior – Credit Risk Modelling| Milan&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:center;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;- Your role and responsibilities &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#39;Segoe UI&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitisation, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;When you join &lt;span style=&quot;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;the Financial Risk team in Milan&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;, &lt;/em&gt;you are going to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;work on &lt;strong&gt;Credit Risk Modelling &lt;/strong&gt;projects, for top-tier clients in the Financial Services sector. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#39;Segoe UI&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&amp;#39;Segoe UI&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;developing models for the quantification of the main credit risk parameters (PD, LGD and EAD) for management and regulatory purposes, in line with Basel regulations;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&amp;#39;Segoe UI&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;assisting clients with stress test;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&amp;#39;Segoe UI&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;contributing to the inclusion of ESG topics in risk measurement;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&amp;#39;Segoe UI&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;measurement of financial instruments (fixed income, securitisation and derivatives);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&amp;#39;Segoe UI&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;implementing pricing models for complex financial instruments (e.g., CLN, ABS, securitisation and CMS);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&amp;#39;Segoe UI&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;restructuring of derivative portfolios and development of the related financial models.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 17.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Come As &lt;a name=&quot;_Int_yZQD4mJ8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;You Are - Your skills and characteristics &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;#39;Segoe UI&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-top:0.0px&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&amp;#39;Segoe UI&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;a specialist degree (graduate or nearing completion) in business, statistics, engineering, mathematics or any other quantitative faculty;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&amp;#39;Segoe UI&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;knowledge of programming software and languages (Python, SAS, R, Matlab and Stata);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&amp;#39;Segoe UI&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;excellent knowledge of Italian and English, preferably with study and/or work experience abroad;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&amp;#39;Segoe UI&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;excellent problem-solving skills and an innate ability to take initiative;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt 0.4px;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;text-indent:0.4px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&amp;#39;Segoe UI&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;good interpersonal and teamwork skills.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable&lt;strong&gt; work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;International&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary of €29,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality”&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; - you will find summarised all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social and governance (ESG) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;#LI-FN1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Junior-Credit-Risk-Modelling-Milan/1366609557/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1366609557</guid><g:id>1366609557</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Risk Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Deal Advisory M&amp;A Tax Senior Consultant | Milano (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your role and responsibilities&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the firm and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. The tax and legal experts at KPMG &lt;strong&gt;Studio Associato &lt;/strong&gt;provide assistance in all the key tax and corporate law areas, offering innovative, integrated services.&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;In particular, by joining the &lt;strong&gt;Deal Advisory M&amp;amp;A Tax Team &lt;/strong&gt;of our Milan office, you will help support clients in addressing challenges related to key areas of taxation. You will operate in a constantly evolving scenario, where national and international regulations intertwine with market and public opinion expectations on crucial topics such as ethics, transparency, and corporate governance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Specifically you will be tasked with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tax due diligence reviews of extraordinary transactions (mergers, demergers, acquisitions, contributions, etc);&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Corporate restructuring;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Analyses of the treatment of extraordinary transactions according to national accounting standards (OIC) and international ones (IAS/IFRS);&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;National and International tax opinions;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Applications for tax rulings;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Preparation of corporate income tax returns (Modello Unico and Modello IRAP).&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;You will be involved in &lt;strong&gt;national&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;international projects&lt;/strong&gt;, working alongside highly qualified professionals and acquiring top-level skills through interaction with the brightest minds in the field.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As &lt;a name=&quot;_Int_yZQD4mJ8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;You Are - &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your skills and characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;3-5 years of professional experience at International Law Firms, the Big Four and/or Advisory Firms;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;A master’s degree in &lt;strong&gt;Economics&lt;/strong&gt; (LM-77 or LM-56) or &lt;strong&gt;Law&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;(LMG-01), &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;with a final grade of at least 100/110;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The intention to pursue the &lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;professional practice&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;as a&lt;strong&gt; C&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;hartered Accountant&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;o&lt;strong&gt;r Lawyer&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;A good knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;Microsoft Office&lt;/strong&gt;, especially Excel and PowerPoint;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Excellent &lt;strong&gt;interpersonal&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable &lt;strong&gt;work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;– Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;environment&lt;/strong&gt;, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt;bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt; - you will find summarised all the &lt;strong&gt;concrete actions&lt;/strong&gt; we are taking on environmental, social and governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Studio Associato is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;#LI-CN1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Deal-Advisory-M&amp;A-Tax-Senior-Consultant-Milano/1356080157/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1356080157</guid><g:id>1356080157</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Tax</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Manager - Microsoft Business Central | Stream Finance (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero &lt;strong&gt;significativo&lt;/strong&gt; e di &lt;strong&gt;impatto&lt;/strong&gt;? In &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; avrai l’opportunità di aiutare &lt;strong&gt;clienti&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;società&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;colleghe&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;colleghi&lt;/strong&gt; ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory&lt;/strong&gt; affianca le imprese nella &lt;strong&gt;trasformazione&lt;/strong&gt; del business model, nel miglioramento e nella &lt;strong&gt;digitalizzazione&lt;/strong&gt; dei processi. Supporta inoltre i clienti nell’analisi e nella gestione dei &lt;strong&gt;rischi&lt;/strong&gt;, così come nelle operazioni di finanza straordinaria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Entrando a far parte del Team Enterprise Platform in qualità di Manager, avrai la responsabilità end-to-end di programmi di Finance Digital Transformation sulla solution Microsoft, con focus su Microsoft Dynamics 365 Business Central, guidando team, clienti e commesse in contesti complessi e multinazionali.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Guidare &lt;/strong&gt;programmi di trasformazione &lt;strong&gt;Finance &lt;/strong&gt;su &lt;strong&gt;Dynamics 365 Business Central&lt;/strong&gt;, dalla strategia di delivery al go-live e oltre&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Definire con i clienti la visione dei &lt;strong&gt;processi target&lt;/strong&gt; e la&lt;strong&gt; roadmap di trasformazione,&lt;/strong&gt; garantendo coerenza con gli obiettivi di business&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Presiedere la &lt;strong&gt;governance del programma&lt;/strong&gt; (piano, rischi, budget, reporting), guidando steering committee e momenti decisionali chiave&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Costruire relazioni dirette con stakeholder C-level, ponendoti come &lt;strong&gt;riferimento strategico&lt;/strong&gt; per il cliente&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Gestire la &lt;strong&gt;responsabilità economica delle commesse&lt;/strong&gt;: budget, forecast e marginalità&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Gestire e far crescere il team, con responsabilità di &lt;strong&gt;people management&lt;/strong&gt;: obiettivi, valutazione delle performance e piani di sviluppo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are – Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Hai maturato esperienza su progetti &lt;strong&gt;Dynamics 365 Business Central &lt;/strong&gt;o soluzioni ERP Finance, con un percorso che ti ha portato a ruoli di&lt;strong&gt; responsabilità manageriale&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Hai guidato in autonomia programmi complessi sui principali &lt;strong&gt;moduli Finance &lt;/strong&gt;(General Ledger, Accounts Payable, Accounts Receivable, Fixed Assets, Cash Management)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Hai esperienza nella &lt;strong&gt;gestione di stakeholder C-leve&lt;/strong&gt;l e nella costruzione di partnership strategiche&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Hai esperienza nella &lt;strong&gt;gestione &lt;/strong&gt;e &lt;strong&gt;sviluppo di team&lt;/strong&gt;, con responsabilità di &lt;strong&gt;people management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Parli fluentemente &lt;strong&gt;inglese &lt;/strong&gt;e lavori con efficacia in contesti internazionali, anche multi-country&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Sei disponibile a &lt;strong&gt;trasferte &lt;/strong&gt;in Italia e all&apos;estero, in base alle esigenze progettuali&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt 36.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;equo&lt;/strong&gt; e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Un contesto &lt;strong&gt;stimolante&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;dinamico&lt;/strong&gt; che incentiva la creatività e il lavoro di squadra&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida&lt;/strong&gt;, per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;sviluppo&lt;/strong&gt; avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Mindset &lt;strong&gt;internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e progettualità &lt;strong&gt;innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio, RAL indicativa compresa tra € 38.000 e € 51.000 per la qualifica di Assistant Manager e tra € 52.000 e € 65.000 per la qualifica di Manager, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi con riferimento specifico alle competenze e all’esperienza del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;, lavoro in &lt;strong&gt;team&lt;/strong&gt;, rispetto di ogni &lt;strong&gt;individualità&lt;/strong&gt;, approfondimento continuo, &lt;strong&gt;trasparenza&lt;/strong&gt;, impegno verso la &lt;strong&gt;comunità&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;integrità&lt;/strong&gt;: questi sono i Valori di &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di esprimere tutto il loro potenziale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un ambiente di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; (Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione) e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt; (parità di genere). All’interno del nostro Impact Plan - Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com) - trovi riassunte tutte le azioni concrete che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (&lt;strong&gt;GDPR&lt;/strong&gt;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l’informativa sulla privacy di &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A.&lt;/strong&gt; garantisce le &lt;strong&gt;pari opportunità&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters – Your role and responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG you&apos;ll have the opportunity to help clients, companies, and colleagues address and solve today&apos;s most current and complex challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory supports businesses in transforming their business model and in improving and digitizing processes. It also supports clients in risk analysis and management, as well as in extraordinary finance operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Joining the Enterprise Platform Team as a Manager, you will take end-to-end responsibility for Finance Digital Transformation programs on the Microsoft solution, with a focus on Microsoft Dynamics 365 Business Central, leading teams, clients, and engagements in complex, multinational contexts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Lead Finance transformation programs on Dynamics 365 Business Central, from delivery strategy through to go-live and beyond&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Define, together with clients, the vision for target processes and the transformation roadmap, ensuring alignment with business objectives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Oversee program governance (plan, risks, budget, reporting), leading steering committees and key decision-making moments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Build direct relationships with C-level stakeholders, positioning yourself as a strategic point of reference for the client&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Manage the financial responsibility of engagements: budget, forecast, and margin&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Manage and develop the team, with direct people management responsibilities: objectives, performance evaluation, and development plans&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are – Your skills and qualities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;This opportunity is right for you if:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;You have gained experience on Dynamics 365 Business Central projects or ERP Finance solutions, on a career path that has led you into roles of managerial responsibility&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;You have independently led complex programs across the main Finance modules (General Ledger, Accounts Payable, Accounts Receivable, Fixed Assets, Cash Management)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;You have experience managing C-level stakeholders and building strategic partnerships&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;You have experience managing and developing teams, with people management responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;You are fluent in English and work effectively in international, multi-country contexts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;You are available to travel within Italy and abroad, according to project needs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us - What you&apos;ll find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;An inclusive, fair working environment that respects, encourages, and values diversity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;A stimulating and dynamic environment that fosters creativity and teamwork&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Hybrid working arrangements, promoting a healthy work-life balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Advanced training and development programs to stay continuously up to date&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;An international mindset and innovative projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on psychophysical wellbeing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a starting gross annual salary ranging from €38,000 to €51,000 for the Assistant Manager position and from €52,000 to €65,000 for the Manager position. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate&apos;s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our values and our commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for individuality, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community, integrity: these are the KPMG Values that bring to life an environment open to the exchange of ideas and knowledge, allowing our professionals to fully express their potential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Thanks to our commitment to fostering an inclusive work environment, our Network is compliant with the ISO 30415 standard (Diversity and Inclusion Management System) and the UNI PdR 125 standard (gender equality). Within our Impact Plan - Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com) - you can find a summary of all the concrete actions we are undertaking on environmental, social, and governance (ESG) topics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) No. 679/2016 (GDPR) and subsequent amendments. For more information, please consult KPMG&apos;s privacy policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. guarantees equal opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;#LI-MM2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Manager-Microsoft-Business-Central-Stream-Finance/1367089757/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1367089757</guid><g:id>1367089757</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Public Sector Consultant - PMO (Roma, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:normal;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;color:#1f3763&quot;&gt;Public Sector Consultant – PMO&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:normal;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;color:#1f3763&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company, and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. KPMG Advisory offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitization, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:normal;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Help digitalize the public administration (PA)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;KPMG has always collaborated with central and local public institutions to support them in&lt;strong&gt; driving change&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt; and innovation processes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;creating a tangible impact on the lives of millions of people.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;As a member of KPMG’s Government team, you will have the opportunity to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;make a difference&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt; by personally contributing to the redesign of your country’s public service delivery models, while rapidly developing your skills in a dynamic and highly professional environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;You will engage daily with the strategic dimensions of public administration, performing activities of:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 23.6px;line-height:normal;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;Support the delivery and coordination of strategic projects within Public Sector organizations &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 23.6px;line-height:normal;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;Develop high-quality executive presentations, reports, briefing papers and decision-making materials &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 23.6px;line-height:normal;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;Produce project governance documentation, including dashboards, KPIs, progress reports, milestone tracking and executive summaries &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 23.6px;line-height:normal;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;Facilitate coordination among client teams, internal project members and external stakeholders &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 23.6px;line-height:normal;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;Support project planning, workstream coordination and monitoring of key priorities and deliverables &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 23.6px;line-height:normal;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;Contribute to communication initiatives aimed at enhancing the visibility and impact of strategic projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-left:23.6px;line-height:normal;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm;margin-left:23.6px;line-height:normal;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:normal;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Are you ready to help change and improve our country?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:normal;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;At KPMG you will be directly involved where change must happen, working closely with the officials and managers of the Italian PA to make public services increasingly user friendly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:normal;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;You will join a group of young colleagues and professionals dedicated to creating and generating the change every day. These colleagues will guide you as you grow and act as a touchstone, in addition to sharing ongoing training programs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;For our offices in Rome, we are seeking driven and accountable professionals who are eager to change the system. They must be goal-oriented, enthusiastic and highly motivated team players.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Come As You Are - Your Skills and Characteristics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;This successful candidate has:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 23.6px;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;Master&apos;s degree in Economics, Law, Political Science or a related field;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 23.6px;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;at least 1 years of experience, preferably with a consulting company and/or supporting the PA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 23.6px;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;Proven experience in project coordination, PMO activities and executive reporting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 23.6px;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;Excellent written communication skills, with the ability to produce high-quality executive presentations, reports and briefing materials&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 23.6px;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;Excellent interpersonal and stakeholder management skills, with the ability to interact effectively across different organizational levels&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 23.6px;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;Ability to work autonomously in complex and fast-paced institutional environments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us - What you&apos;ll find at KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:normal;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;An inclusive, equitable work environment that respects, encourages and values diversity &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:normal;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages creativity and teamwork&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:normal;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;Hybrid work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:normal;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;Advanced training and development programs to stay current&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:normal;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;International mindset and innovative projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:normal;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on mental and physical well-being&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;line-height:107%;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary ranging from €30,000 to €33,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;line-height:107%;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Together for Better - Our Values and Commitment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for each individuality, continuous deepening, transparency, commitment to the community, integrity: these are KPMG&apos;s Values that give rise to an environment open to the exchange of ideas and knowledge, which allows our professionals to express their full potential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an inclusive work environment, our Network has obtained ISO 30415 certification, which certifies compliance of the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and UNI PdR 125, which certifies gender equality. Within our Impact Plan&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt; - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; (kpmg.com)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt; - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;you will find summarized all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social and governance (ESG) issues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:normal;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:normal;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) No. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”) as amended. For more information, please see KPMG&apos;s privacy policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:normal;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#3c3c3c&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. guarantees equal opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:normal;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LI-SB1&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Roma-Public-Sector-Consultant-PMO/1367233757/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1367233757</guid><g:id>1367233757</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Roma, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Tax Consultant | Torino (Torino, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;div id=&quot;tor__fextListingLayout_readOnlyDiv&quot;&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;tor__fextListingLayout_content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters - Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. I professionisti dello &lt;strong&gt;Studio Associato &lt;/strong&gt;di KPMG intervengono in tutte le principali aree della fiscalità e del diritto societario offrendo servizi integrati e innovativi.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In particolare, entrando a far parte del &lt;strong&gt;Tax Department &lt;/strong&gt;di &lt;strong&gt;Torino&lt;/strong&gt;, contribuirai a supportare i clienti nell&apos;affrontare le sfide legate alle principali aree della fiscalità. Opererai in uno scenario in continua evoluzione, dove normative nazionali e internazionali si intrecciano con le aspettative del mercato e dell’opinione pubblica su temi cruciali come l’etica, la trasparenza e la corporate governance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analizzare problematiche relative alla fiscalità diretta e indiretta nazionale e fornire consulenza continuativa alle aziende;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Redigere pareri in materia fiscale italiana e internazionale (CFC, black list, stabili organizzazioni, ritenute, ecc.);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analizzare la fiscalità delle operazioni straordinarie (fusioni, scissioni, conferimenti, ecc.);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effettuare attività di &lt;strong&gt;tax due diligence&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gestire attività di &lt;strong&gt;tax compliance&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sarai coinvolta/o su &lt;strong&gt;progetti nazionali &lt;/strong&gt;e&lt;strong&gt; internazionali, &lt;/strong&gt;lavorando al fianco di professioniste e professionisti altamente qualificati e acquisendo competenze di primo livello attraverso il confronto con le menti più brillanti del settore.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hai una laurea magistrale in &lt;strong&gt;Economia&lt;/strong&gt; (LM 77 o LM 56) o Giurisprudenza (LMG 01) con votazione almeno pari a 100/110&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hai l’abilitazione alla professione di &lt;strong&gt;Dottore Commercialista/Avvocato&lt;/strong&gt; o la volontà di intraprendere la &lt;strong&gt;pratica professionale&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hai una buona padronanza della &lt;strong&gt;lingua inglese&lt;/strong&gt;, preferibilmente con esperienze di studio e/o lavoro all&apos;estero&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Buona conoscenza di Office, in particolare Excel e Power Point&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ottime capacità relazionali e di team working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network ha ottenuto le &lt;strong&gt;certificazioni ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, che attesta la conformità del Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, che certifica la parità di genere. All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;em&gt;bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG&lt;/em&gt; - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni concrete&lt;/strong&gt; che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Studio Associato garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters – Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the firm and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. The tax and legal experts at KPMG &lt;strong&gt;Studio Associato &lt;/strong&gt;provide assistance in all the key tax and corporate law areas, offering innovative, integrated services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In particular, by joining the &lt;strong&gt;Tax Department &lt;/strong&gt;of our &lt;strong&gt;Turin&lt;/strong&gt; office, you will help support clients in addressing challenges related to key areas of taxation. You will operate in a constantly evolving scenario, where national and international regulations intertwine with market and public opinion expectations on crucial topics such as ethics, transparency, and corporate governance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Specifically you will be tasked with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analysing issues concerning domestic direct and indirect taxation and offering ongoing advice to companies;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expressing opinions on Italian and international tax matters (CFCs, blacklists, permanent establishments, withholding tax, etc.);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analysing the taxation of extraordinary transactions (mergers, demergers, contributions, etc.);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tax due diligence;      &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tax compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be involved in &lt;strong&gt;national&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;international projects&lt;/strong&gt;, working alongside highly qualified professionals and acquiring top-level skills through interaction with the brightest minds in the field.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are – Your Skills and Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This opportunity is perfect for you if:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You hold a Master’s degree in Economics (LM 77 or LM 56) or Law (LMG 01) with a final grade of at least 100/110&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are either a certified &lt;strong&gt;Chartered Accountant/Lawyer &lt;/strong&gt;or intend to begin the professional training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a &lt;strong&gt;good command of English&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally supported by study and/or work experiences abroad&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a good working knowledge of Office tools, especially &lt;strong&gt;Excel and PowerPoint&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You possess strong interpersonal and &lt;strong&gt;teamworking skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us – What You’ll Find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive and equitable work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages, and values diversity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dynamic and stimulating setting that fosters &lt;strong&gt;creativity and collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training and development programs&lt;/strong&gt; to keep your skills up to date&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An international mindset and innovative projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;– Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;environment&lt;/strong&gt;, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;em&gt;bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG&lt;/em&gt; - you will find summarised all the &lt;strong&gt;concrete actions&lt;/strong&gt; we are taking on environmental, social and governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Studio Associato is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;#LI-VG1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Torino-Tax-Consultant-Torino/1361783657/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1361783657</guid><g:id>1361783657</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Tax</g:job_function><g:location>Torino, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Eu policy and International government consultant/Senior Consultant (Roma, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;EU POLICY - Government Consultant/Senior consultant&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your Role and Responsibilities.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG is one of the leading companies in the world providing professional services to public, private and non-profit organisations in a wide variety of services and sectors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG Italy team focusing on EU institutions and international organisations (World Bank, United Nations, …) is quickly growing and seek a new EU policy consultant/senior consultant.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;The successful candidate will be actively involved in service delivery for different Directorate-Generals of the European Commission and agencies across the EU, as well as business development activities to strengthen the growth of the KPMG IT European team. The role includes conducting projects and studies to support policy-making and assisting clients with the implementation of policy initiatives as well as stakeholder engagement and management consulting projects for EU institutions. This may include research, evaluations and impact assessments, stakeholder management and communication, the development of new strategies, providing guidance during transformations, and improving existing business processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, your responsibilities will include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Participate to the delivery of EU projects covering EU policy studies and/or Impact, assessment monitoring and evaluation according to Better Regulations methodology and/or stakeholder engagement and management consulting for EU institutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Support the project manager in coordinating activities for project implementation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Cooperate with other team members to disseminate knowledge about EU policy and Better regulation methodologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Carry out and coordinate quantitative/qualitative data analysis, including market analysis, CBA, cost assessments, indicators framework set-up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Support Business Development activities especially on EU policy studies, Better Regulation studies but also on a varied of other EU opportunities:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;circle&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Tendering drafting and coordination of more junior resources for quality results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Analyse policy context and participate to EU tenders procedures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Participate to consortia building for EU tenders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you ready to help change and improve our country?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You will join a group of young colleagues and professionals dedicated to creating and generating the change every day. These colleagues will guide you as you grow and act as a touchstone, in addition to sharing ongoing training programmes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;For our offices in &lt;strong&gt;Rome&lt;/strong&gt;, we are recruiting professionals with drive and a sense of accountability to change the system. They must be goal-oriented, enthusiastic and highly motivated team players.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are - Your Skills and Characteristics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The successful candidate has:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;at least 1 to 3 years of experience (depending on the seniority) in other consultancies working for EU institutions (this is a pre-condition and will be checked)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;a University Graduate Degree in EU policies, Public Policy, PPE, or related.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;It is considered a plus having professional experience or academic background in policymaking according to Better Regulation methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;an experience working for international institutions or within an international consulting firm, you are familiar with international institutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;a positive and confident approach with good interpersonal skills and you are at ease with a multicultural, multinational and culturally diverse environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;an excellent spoken and written knowledge of English and Italian. Knowledge of another EU language is most welcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;readiness to adapt to a fast changing work environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us - What you&apos;ll find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An inclusive, equitable work environment that respects, encourages and values diversity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages creativity and teamwork&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hybrid work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced training and development programs to stay current&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;International mindset and innovative projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on mental and physical well-being&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary ranging from €30,000 to €33,000 for the consultant position and from €31,000 to €41,000 for the senior consultant position. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better - Our Values and Commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for each individuality, continuous deepening, transparency, commitment to the community, integrity: these are KPMG&apos;s Values that give rise to an environment open to the exchange of ideas and knowledge, which allows our professionals to express their full potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality.  Within our Impact Plan - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - you will find summarized all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social and governance (ESG) issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) No. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”) as amended. For more information, please see KPMG&apos;s privacy policy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. guarantees equal opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-SB1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Roma-Eu-policy-and-International-government-consultantSenior-Consultant/1367369357/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1367369357</guid><g:id>1367369357</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Roma, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Senior Tax Consultant - Family Office &amp; Private Client | Roma/Milano (Roma, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Tax Consultant &lt;em&gt;–&lt;/em&gt; Family Office &amp;amp; Private Client&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your role and responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Vuoi intraprendere una professione davvero significativa e d’impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare clienti, l’azienda e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Grazie ai suoi esperti altamente qualificati in ambito fiscale e legale, &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Studio Associato&lt;/strong&gt; fornisce assistenza in tutte le principali aree del diritto tributario e societario, offrendo servizi innovativi e integrati. I team di lavoro sono specializzati sia per ambito professionale che per settore di clientela. Con oltre &lt;strong&gt;600 professionisti&lt;/strong&gt; distribuiti in &lt;strong&gt;12 sedi&lt;/strong&gt; nelle principali città italiane, l’unità fiscale e legale del network KPMG è una delle principali realtà professionali nel Paese.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Per il nostro team &lt;strong&gt;Family Office &amp;amp; Private Client&lt;/strong&gt; presso l’ufficio di &lt;strong&gt;Roma &lt;/strong&gt;o &lt;strong&gt;Milano&lt;/strong&gt;, siamo alla ricerca di un professionista che sarà responsabile di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;In via primaria, compliance fiscale per persone fisiche (dichiarazioni dei redditi, quadro RW, fiscalità degli strumenti finanziari, adempimenti e controlli).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;In via subordinata, consulenza su imposte dirette e indirette, strumenti di passaggio generazionale e protezione del patrimonio.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Ricerche normative/prassi, redazione memo e supporto nei rapporti con l’Amministrazione Finanziaria.&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Questa è l’opportunità perfetta per te se hai:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Laurea magistrale in discipline economiche (LM-56 o LM-77) o giuridiche (LMG-01);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Esperienza di 2-5 anni maturata presso uno studio legale internazionale, una Big Four e/o una società di consulenza;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Abilitazione o volontà di intraprendere la pratica professionale come Dottore commercialista e/o Avvocato;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Ottima conoscenza della lingua inglese;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Ottima conoscenza del pacchetto Microsoft Office;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Ottime capacità relazionali e attitudine al lavoro di squadra;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Spiccate capacità organizzative, spirito d’iniziativa e problem solving;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Approccio flessibile e dinamico.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Sarà considerato un plus un Master di II livello in Diritto Tributario.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt; ed &lt;strong&gt;equo&lt;/strong&gt;, che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza la &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Un contesto &lt;strong&gt;sfidante e dinamico&lt;/strong&gt; che favorisce la creatività e il lavoro di squadra;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione e sviluppo&lt;/strong&gt; avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Un mindset internazionale e &lt;strong&gt;progetti innovativi&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Iniziative dedicate al &lt;strong&gt;benessere mentale e fisico&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro di squadra, rispetto per ogni individuo, apprendimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità e integrità. Questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che creano un ambiente in cui è possibile condividere idee e conoscenze affinché i nostri professionisti possano &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere. All&apos;interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; – [Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)] – sono sintetizzate tutte le azioni concrete che stiamo portando avanti in materia ambientale, sociale e di governance (ESG).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), come modificato. Per ulteriori informazioni, consulta l’informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Studio Associato è un datore di lavoro che offre pari opportunità.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Tax Consultant &lt;em&gt;–&lt;/em&gt; Family Office &amp;amp; Private Client&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters – Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Do you want to start a truly meaningful and impactful career? At KPMG you’ll have the opportunity to help your firm, clients and colleagues address and resolve some of today’s most topical and complex issues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;With around &lt;strong&gt;600 professionals&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;12 offices&lt;/strong&gt; located in Italy&apos;s largest cities, &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Tax &amp;amp; Legal&lt;/strong&gt; is one of the leading professional partnerships in the country, assisting clients in all key areas of tax and corporate law. Its highly qualified teams specialize in both practice areas and client sectors, offering integrated and innovative services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Our &lt;strong&gt;Family Office &amp;amp; Private Client&lt;/strong&gt; team in &lt;strong&gt;Milan &lt;/strong&gt;or &lt;strong&gt;Rome&lt;/strong&gt; is recruiting for a graduate who will:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;primarily, provide tax compliance services to private clients, including assistance with income tax returns, foreign asset reporting (RW forms), and the taxation of financial instruments;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;in addition, advise on direct and indirect taxation, succession and estate planning, and wealth management strategies;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;conduct complex research into literature, case law and statements of practice, draft reports and opinions and handle dealings with the Italian Revenue Agency.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Qualifications&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;, Skills, and Characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;a master&apos;s degree in economics (LM-56 or LM-77) or law (LMG-01);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;qualified as a chartered accountant and/or lawyer or wish to begin your qualifying work experience;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;2-5 years’ experience at an international law firm, the Big Four and/or an advisory firm;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;an excellent knowledge of English;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;an excellent knowledge of Microsoft Office;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;excellent interpersonal and teamwork skills;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;strong organizational skills, initiative, and problem-solving abilities;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;a flexible and dynamic approach.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;A postgraduate second-level master’s in tax law would be a plus.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us – What You&apos;ll Find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;equitable&lt;/strong&gt; work environment that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;stimulating&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;dynamic&lt;/strong&gt; environment that fosters creativity and teamworking.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training and development&lt;/strong&gt; programs to support continuous learning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;international outlook&lt;/strong&gt; and a focus on &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Physical and mental well-being&lt;/strong&gt; initiatives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for each individual, continuous learning, transparency, community engagement, and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG values &lt;/strong&gt;that foster an open environment for the exchange of ideas and knowledge. KPMG supports all its people in reaching their full potential, whatever their identity or background. Fully committed to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, we are &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415 compliant &lt;/strong&gt;(ISO 30415:2021 – Human Resources Management – Diversity and Inclusion). KPMG in Italy is also compliant with &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125 &lt;/strong&gt;(UNI/PdR 125:2022 – measures to ensure gender equality in audit and assurance services). You can find a summary of all our &lt;strong&gt;concrete&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;ESG &lt;/strong&gt;(environmental, social, and governance) &lt;strong&gt;actions&lt;/strong&gt; in our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;here&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG in Italy is an Equal Opportunity Employer&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with Regulation (EU) 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation – “GDPR”) as subsequently amended. For more information, please refer to KPMG’s privacy notice.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;#LI-CN1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Roma-Senior-Tax-Consultant-Family-Office-&amp;-Private-Client-RomaMilano/1367778657/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1367778657</guid><g:id>1367778657</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Tax</g:job_function><g:location>Roma, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Global Mobility Services Consultant | Roma (Roma, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:18.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Mobility Services Consultant | Roma&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters - Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. I professionisti dello &lt;strong&gt;Studio Associato &lt;/strong&gt;di KPMG intervengono in tutte le principali aree della fiscalità e del diritto societario offrendo servizi integrati e innovativi.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In particolare, entrando a far parte del &lt;strong&gt;Tax Department&lt;/strong&gt; di &lt;strong&gt;Roma&lt;/strong&gt;, contribuirai a supportare i clienti nell&apos;affrontare le sfide legate alle principali aree della fiscalità. Opererai in uno scenario in continua evoluzione, dove normative nazionali e internazionali si intrecciano con le aspettative del mercato e dell’opinione pubblica su temi cruciali come l’etica, la trasparenza e la corporate governance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nello specifico, nel team &lt;strong&gt;Global Mobility Services &lt;/strong&gt;ti occuperai di:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;attività di tax advisory per persone fisiche su tematiche fiscali italiane e internazionali per personale espatriato;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;analisi di questioni fiscali internazionali in coordinamento con gli uffici esteri;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;attività di tax compliance per persone fisiche.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se possiedi:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;una laurea magistrale in Economia (LM 77/56) o Giurisprudenza;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;una buona conoscenza della lingua inglese (la conoscenza di una seconda lingua straniera sarà considerata un plus);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;una buona padronanza di Microsoft Office, in particolare Excel e PowerPoint;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;interesse per la consulenza fiscale internazionale rivolta alle persone fisiche;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;volontà di iniziare la pratica professionale finalizzata all&apos;iscrizione all’Albo dei Dottori Commercialisti o degli Avvocati.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere. All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;em&gt;bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG&lt;/em&gt; - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni concrete&lt;/strong&gt; che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Studio Associato garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Mobility Services Consultant | Roma&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters – Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you looking for meaningful and impactful work? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to support clients, society, and your colleagues in addressing and solving today’s most pressing and complex challenges. The professionals at KPMG Studio Associato operate across all major areas of taxation and corporate law, providing integrated and innovative services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For our &lt;strong&gt;Rome office&lt;/strong&gt;, we are looking for a professional to join the &lt;strong&gt;Global Mobility Services&lt;/strong&gt; team who will be tasked with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;tax advisory activities for individuals regarding Italian and international taxation issues for expatiate personnel;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;analysing international tax issues in coordination with foreign offices;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;tax compliance activities for individuals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are – Your Skills and Qualifications&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This opportunity is perfect for you if you have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;a master&apos;s degree in business (LM 77/56) or law;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;a good knowledge of English and a second foreign language is an advantage;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;a good knowledge of Microsoft Office, especially Excel and PowerPoint;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;an interest in exploring international tax advice for individuals;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enrollment in the Italian Register of Chartered Accountants&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;Bar Association&lt;/strong&gt; (or proof of completed internship).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates with the following will have an advantage:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;excellent interpersonal and teamwork skills;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;curiosity, flexible and dynamic approach;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;strong organisational skills and an ability to effectively prioritise tasks;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;an understanding of the global economic and geopolitical context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us – What You’ll Find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive and equitable&lt;/strong&gt; work environment that respects, encourages, and values diversity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;stimulating and dynamic&lt;/strong&gt; setting that promotes creativity and teamwork&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced training and development programs&lt;/strong&gt; to stay up to date&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;international mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and a focus on innovative projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;physical and mental well-being&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for each individual, continuous learning, transparency, community engagement, and integrity—these are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Values&lt;/strong&gt; that foster an open environment for the exchange of ideas and knowledge, enabling our professionals to fully express their potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. You can find a summary of all our concrete actions on environmental, social, and governance (ESG) matters in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG&quot; target=&quot;_new&quot;&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with Regulation (EU) No. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation – &quot;GDPR&quot;) and subsequent amendments. For more information, please refer to KPMG’s privacy notice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPMG Studio Associato is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;#LI-AL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Roma-Global-Mobility-Services-Consultant-Roma/1354540257/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1354540257</guid><g:id>1354540257</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Tax</g:job_function><g:location>Roma, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior Transfer Pricing Consultant | Padova (Padova, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;div id=&quot;tor__fextListingLayout_readOnlyDiv&quot;&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;tor__fextListingLayout_content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Junior Transfer Pricing Consultant | Padova&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. I professionisti dello &lt;strong&gt;Studio Associato&lt;/strong&gt; di KPMG intervengono in tutte le principali aree della fiscalità e del diritto societario offrendo servizi integrati e innovativi.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In particolare, entrando a far parte del team &lt;strong&gt;Transfer Pricing &lt;/strong&gt;di &lt;strong&gt;Padova&lt;/strong&gt;, contribuirai a supportare i clienti nell&apos;affrontare le sfide legate alle principali aree della fiscalità. Opererai in uno scenario in continua evoluzione, dove normative nazionali e internazionali si intrecciano con le aspettative del mercato e dell’opinione pubblica su temi cruciali come l’etica, la trasparenza e la corporate governance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strutturare ed eseguire analisi di conformità alla normativa fiscale italiana e alle linee guida OCSE, sotto la supervisione di consulenti più esperti;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analizzare la catena del valore dei gruppi attraverso interviste al management;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analizzare bilanci e contratti infragruppo;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eseguire analisi di benchmarking;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Redigere la documentazione sul transfer pricing sotto la supervisione di consulenti più esperti;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sviluppare le proprie conoscenze teoriche in materia di fiscalità internazionale, anche attraverso attività di ricerca su tematiche specifiche.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Questa è l’opportunità perfetta per te se hai:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Laurea magistrale in discipline economiche o giuridiche;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Volontà di intraprendere la pratica professionale come dottore commercialista e/o avvocato;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ottima conoscenza della lingua inglese;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ottima conoscenza del pacchetto Microsoft Office;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ottime capacità relazionali e attitudine al lavoro di squadra;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spiccate capacità organizzative, spirito d’iniziativa e problem solving;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Approccio flessibile e dinamico.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sarà considerato un plus un Master di II livello in Diritto Tributario.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Il tuo futuro con noi – Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un ambiente di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt; ed &lt;strong&gt;equo&lt;/strong&gt;, che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza la &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un contesto &lt;strong&gt;sfidante e dinamico&lt;/strong&gt; che favorisce la creatività e il lavoro di squadra;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere l’equilibrio tra vita professionale e privata;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione e sviluppo&lt;/strong&gt; avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un mindset internazionale e &lt;strong&gt;progetti innovativi&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Iniziative dedicate al &lt;strong&gt;benessere mentale e fisico&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Insieme per un futuro migliore – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership, lavoro di squadra, rispetto per ogni individuo, apprendimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità e integrità. Questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che creano un ambiente in cui è possibile condividere idee e conoscenze affinché i nostri professionisti possano &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere. All&apos;interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; – [Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)] – sono sintetizzate tutte le azioni concrete che stiamo portando avanti in materia ambientale, sociale e di governance (ESG).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), come modificato. Per ulteriori informazioni, consulta l’informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Studio Associato è un datore di lavoro che offre pari opportunità.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your role and responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With its highly qualified tax and legal experts, &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Studio Associato&lt;/strong&gt; provides assistance in all the key tax and corporate law areas, offering innovative, integrated services. Its work teams specialise in both professional field and client sector. With over &lt;strong&gt;500 professionals &lt;/strong&gt;at &lt;strong&gt;12 offices &lt;/strong&gt;in Italy&apos;s largest cities, the KPMG network&apos;s Tax and legal unit is one of the top professional partnerships in the country.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are recruiting a professional to join our &lt;strong&gt;Transfer Pricing&lt;/strong&gt; team in &lt;strong&gt;Padua&lt;/strong&gt;, who will perform international tax analyses to establish the transfer prices of goods, services and financial transactions between companies in the same industrial or financial group, in order to determine the proper tax base in each tax jurisdiction in which the group operates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Specifically, the successful candidate will be tasked with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structuring and performing compliance analyses with Italian tax legislation and the OECD guidelines, under the supervision of more senior consultants;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analysing the value chain of groups by interviewing management;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analysing financial statements and intragroup contracts;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance of benchmarking analysis;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drafting of transfer pricing documentation under the supervision of more senior consultants;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing their theoretical knowledge of the international tax matters that could be the subject of specific research.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master’s degree in business (LM-56 and LM-77) or Law (LMG-01);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualification to practice as a lawyer or chartered accountant, or willingness to obtain such qualifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent knowledge of English;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent knowledge of Microsoft Office, especially Excel;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent interpersonal and teamwork skills;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible and dynamic approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A post-graduate specialisation in Tax Law would be a definite plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;•    An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive &lt;/strong&gt;and equitable &lt;strong&gt;work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;•    A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages &lt;strong&gt;creativity &lt;/strong&gt;and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;br&gt;•    &lt;strong&gt;Hybrid &lt;/strong&gt;work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance.&lt;br&gt;•    Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training &lt;/strong&gt;and development programmes to stay current.&lt;br&gt;•    &lt;strong&gt;International mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and&lt;strong&gt; innovative projects&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;•    Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG values&lt;/strong&gt; that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - you will find summarised all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social and governance (ESG) issues.  &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Studio Associato is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-MS1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;table width=&quot;100%&quot;&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;height:36.0px&quot;&gt; &lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Padova-Junior-Transfer-Pricing-Consultant-Padova/1368020257/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1368020257</guid><g:id>1368020257</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Tax</g:job_function><g:location>Padova, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Transfer Pricing Consultant | Padova (Padova, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;div id=&quot;tor__fextListingLayout_readOnlyDiv&quot;&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;tor__fextListingLayout_content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Junior Transfer Pricing Consultant | Padova&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. I professionisti dello &lt;strong&gt;Studio Associato&lt;/strong&gt; di KPMG intervengono in tutte le principali aree della fiscalità e del diritto societario offrendo servizi integrati e innovativi.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In particolare, entrando a far parte del team &lt;strong&gt;Transfer Pricing &lt;/strong&gt;di &lt;strong&gt;Padova&lt;/strong&gt;, contribuirai a supportare i clienti nell&apos;affrontare le sfide legate alle principali aree della fiscalità. Opererai in uno scenario in continua evoluzione, dove normative nazionali e internazionali si intrecciano con le aspettative del mercato e dell’opinione pubblica su temi cruciali come l’etica, la trasparenza e la corporate governance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strutturare ed eseguire analisi di conformità alla normativa fiscale italiana e alle linee guida OCSE, sotto la supervisione di consulenti più esperti;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analizzare la catena del valore dei gruppi attraverso interviste al management;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analizzare bilanci e contratti infragruppo;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eseguire analisi di benchmarking;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Redigere la documentazione sul transfer pricing sotto la supervisione di consulenti più esperti;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sviluppare le proprie conoscenze teoriche in materia di fiscalità internazionale, anche attraverso attività di ricerca su tematiche specifiche.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Questa è l’opportunità perfetta per te se hai:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Da 1 a 2 anni di esperienza nel Transfer Pricing;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Laurea magistrale in discipline economiche o giuridiche;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Volontà di intraprendere la pratica professionale come dottore commercialista e/o avvocato;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ottima conoscenza della lingua inglese;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ottima conoscenza del pacchetto Microsoft Office;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ottime capacità relazionali e attitudine al lavoro di squadra;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spiccate capacità organizzative, spirito d’iniziativa e problem solving;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Approccio flessibile e dinamico.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sarà considerato un plus un Master di II livello in Diritto Tributario.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Il tuo futuro con noi – Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un ambiente di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt; ed &lt;strong&gt;equo&lt;/strong&gt;, che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza la &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un contesto &lt;strong&gt;sfidante e dinamico&lt;/strong&gt; che favorisce la creatività e il lavoro di squadra;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere l’equilibrio tra vita professionale e privata;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione e sviluppo&lt;/strong&gt; avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un mindset internazionale e &lt;strong&gt;progetti innovativi&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Iniziative dedicate al &lt;strong&gt;benessere mentale e fisico&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Insieme per un futuro migliore – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership, lavoro di squadra, rispetto per ogni individuo, apprendimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità e integrità. Questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che creano un ambiente in cui è possibile condividere idee e conoscenze affinché i nostri professionisti possano &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere. All&apos;interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; – [Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)] – sono sintetizzate tutte le azioni concrete che stiamo portando avanti in materia ambientale, sociale e di governance (ESG).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), come modificato. Per ulteriori informazioni, consulta l’informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Studio Associato è un datore di lavoro che offre pari opportunità.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your role and responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With its highly qualified tax and legal experts, &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Studio Associato&lt;/strong&gt; provides assistance in all the key tax and corporate law areas, offering innovative, integrated services. Its work teams specialise in both professional field and client sector. With over &lt;strong&gt;500 professionals &lt;/strong&gt;at &lt;strong&gt;12 offices &lt;/strong&gt;in Italy&apos;s largest cities, the KPMG network&apos;s Tax and legal unit is one of the top professional partnerships in the country.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are recruiting a professional to join our &lt;strong&gt;Transfer Pricing&lt;/strong&gt; team in &lt;strong&gt;Padua&lt;/strong&gt;, who will perform international tax analyses to establish the transfer prices of goods, services and financial transactions between companies in the same industrial or financial group, in order to determine the proper tax base in each tax jurisdiction in which the group operates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Specifically, the successful candidate will be tasked with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structuring and performing compliance analyses with Italian tax legislation and the OECD guidelines, under the supervision of more senior consultants;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analysing the value chain of groups by interviewing management;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analysing financial statements and intragroup contracts;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance of benchmarking analysis;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drafting of transfer pricing documentation under the supervision of more senior consultants;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing their theoretical knowledge of the international tax matters that could be the subject of specific research.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;0 to 2 years of experience in Transfer Pricing;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master’s degree in business (LM-56 and LM-77) or Law (LMG-01);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualification to practice as a lawyer or chartered accountant, or willingness to obtain such qualifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent knowledge of English;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent knowledge of Microsoft Office, especially Excel;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent interpersonal and teamwork skills;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible and dynamic approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A post-graduate specialisation in Tax Law would be a definite plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;•    An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive &lt;/strong&gt;and equitable &lt;strong&gt;work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;•    A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages &lt;strong&gt;creativity &lt;/strong&gt;and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;br&gt;•    &lt;strong&gt;Hybrid &lt;/strong&gt;work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance.&lt;br&gt;•    Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training &lt;/strong&gt;and development programmes to stay current.&lt;br&gt;•    &lt;strong&gt;International mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and&lt;strong&gt; innovative projects&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;•    Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG values&lt;/strong&gt; that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - you will find summarised all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social and governance (ESG) issues.  &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Studio Associato is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-MS1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;table width=&quot;100%&quot;&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;height:36.0px&quot;&gt; &lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Padova-Transfer-Pricing-Consultant-Padova/1368020357/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1368020357</guid><g:id>1368020357</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Tax</g:job_function><g:location>Padova, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior - Actuarial Services | Roma (Roma, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:center;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:20.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Junior Consultant – Actuarial Services| Roma&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:center;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:20.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;L&apos;opportunità di costruire un futuro migliore è proprio davanti a te&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters – Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Desideri intraprendere una professione davvero significativa e d’impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare clienti, azienda e colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. KPMG Advisory offre servizi di consulenza alle imprese per supportarle nella trasformazione del modello di business, nel miglioramento e nella digitalizzazione dei processi, nell’analisi e gestione dei rischi e nelle operazioni di finanza straordinaria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Entrando a far parte del team lavorerai su progetti di Actuarial Services per clienti di primaria importanza del settore assicurativo.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt&quot;&gt;• &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;IFRS 17, Solvency II, gestione del capitale, supporto nelle operazioni di M&amp;amp;A, data analytics e automazione nell’ambito delle assicurazioni vita;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;• IFRS 17, Solvency II, riserve tecniche, pricing, riassicurazione, pianificazione e data analytics nell’ambito delle assicurazioni danni.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Come As You Are – Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Questa è l’opportunità ideale per te se:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;• possiedi una laurea magistrale in Scienze Statistiche e Attuariali, oppure in Economia con specializzazione in tecniche attuariali, finanza e risk management;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;• hai un’ottima conoscenza della lingua inglese, preferibilmente supportata da esperienze di studio e/o lavoro all’estero;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;• possiedi un’eccellente conoscenza del pacchetto Microsoft Office.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us – Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt&quot;&gt;• &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo ed equo che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza la diversità.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;• Un contesto dinamico e stimolante che favorisce creatività e lavoro di squadra.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;• Modalità di lavoro ibride per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita privata e professionale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;• Programmi avanzati di formazione e sviluppo professionale per mantenere competenze sempre aggiornate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;• Mentalità internazionale e partecipazione a progetti innovativi.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;• Iniziative dedicate al benessere mentale e fisico.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio, RAL di ingresso: € 29.000, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi quali il titolo di studio e la valutazione del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro di squadra, rispetto per ogni individuo, apprendimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità e integrità. Questi sono i valori di KPMG, che contribuiscono a creare un ambiente che promuove la condivisione di idee e conoscenze, consentendo ai nostri professionisti di esprimere appieno il proprio potenziale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A conferma del nostro impegno nel promuovere un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo, il nostro Network è conforme ai requisiti della norma ISO 30415 sul Sistema di Gestione della Diversità e Inclusione e della UNI/PdR 125, relativa alla parità di genere.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;All’interno del nostro Impact Plan – Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com) troverai una sintesi di tutte le azioni concrete che stiamo intraprendendo sui temi ambientali, sociali e di governance (ESG).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (Regolamento Generale sulla Protezione dei Dati – “GDPR”), e successive modifiche. Per maggiori informazioni, ti invitiamo a consultare l’informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. garantisce pari opportunità a tutti i candidati.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:center;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:20.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:20.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:center;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:20.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Junior Consultant – Actuarial Services| Rome&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:center;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;- Your role and responsibilities &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitisation, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;When you join &lt;span style=&quot;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;the team,&lt;/span&gt; you are going to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;work on &lt;strong&gt;Actuarial Services &lt;/strong&gt;projects, for top-tier clients in the Insurance sector. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;color:#3c3c3c;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;IFRS 17, Solvency II, capital management, support in M&amp;amp;As, data analytics and automation in the life insurance line;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;color:#3c3c3c;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;IFRS 17, Solvency II, reserves, pricing, reinsurance, planning and data analytics in the non-life insurance lines.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 17.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Come As &lt;a name=&quot;_Int_yZQD4mJ8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;You Are - Your skills and characteristics &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:#3c3c3c;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;have a master’s degree in statistical and actuarial sciences, or in business with a specialisation in actuarial techniques, finance and risk management;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:#3c3c3c;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;excellent knowledge of English, preferably with study and/or work experience abroad; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:#3c3c3c;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;excellent knowledge of Microsoft Office.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 17.0pt;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable&lt;strong&gt; work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;International&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary of €29,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;color:windowtext&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; - you will find summarised all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social and governance (ESG) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-FN1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Roma-Junior-Actuarial-Services-Roma/1368214657/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1368214657</guid><g:id>1368214657</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Risk Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Roma, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Senior Legal Consultant | Firenze (Firenze, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters - Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. I professionisti dello &lt;strong&gt;Studio Associato &lt;/strong&gt;di KPMG intervengono in tutte le principali aree della fiscalità e del diritto societario offrendo servizi integrati e innovativi.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white&quot;&gt;In particolare, entrando a far parte del Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Legal &amp;amp; Compliance &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white&quot;&gt;di &lt;strong&gt;Firenze&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, contribuirai a supportare i clienti nell&apos;affrontare le sfide legate alle principali aree del diritto societario. Opererai in uno scenario in continua evoluzione, dove normative nazionali e internazionali si intrecciano con le aspettative del mercato e dell’opinione pubblica su temi cruciali come l’etica, la trasparenza e la corporate governance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Assistenza in ambito di diritto civile e societario, segreteria societaria (preparazione di convocazioni, minute di verbali di organi sociali).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Assistenza nella redazione di pareri scritti ed orali in materia di diritto civile e societario.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Assistenza nella redazione di contrattualistica di impresa.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Assistenza nell’ambito di operazioni straordinarie sell side e buy side, svolgimento di due diligence di natura legale; assistenza al perfezionamento di operazioni di fusione e scissione e structuring di operazioni straordinarie; acquisto e vendita di partecipazioni societarie, acquisto e vendita di azienda e rami d’azienda, stipula di accordi quadro, patti parasociali, lettere di intenti, memorandum of understandings, non-disclosure agreement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Assistenza in materia di compliance normativa per la redazione ed implementazione di Modelli di compliance normativa Antiriciclaggio, Diritto delle Società Quotate, Antitrust, Anticorruzione, D.lgs. n. 231/2001, Sicurezza sul lavoro, Ambientale, Rating di legalità e ESG.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Assistenza nel monitoraggio degli aggiornamenti normativi con particolare riferimento alle normative: Antiriciclaggio; Diritto delle Società Quotate, Responsabilità amministrativa degli enti ex d.lgs. n. 231/2001, Anticorruzione e Trasparenza; Antitrust, ed ESG.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Assistenza nella redazione di Regolamenti e Policy di Governance e di Global Policy nell’ambito di Gruppi Internazionali.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Assistenza nello svolgimento di attività formative in ambito di compliance normativa.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Assistenza nella redazione di atti giudiziari e nell’ambito del contenzioso civile e societario, attività di recupero crediti.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Sarai coinvolta/o su &lt;strong&gt;progetti nazionali &lt;/strong&gt;e&lt;strong&gt; internazionali, &lt;/strong&gt;lavorando al fianco di professioniste e professionisti altamente qualificati e acquisendo competenze di primo livello attraverso il confronto con le menti più brillanti del settore.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se hai:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Esperienza professionale da 3 a 5 anni presso primari studi nazionali o internazionali e/o società di consulenza; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Laurea magistrale a ciclo unico in giurisprudenza, preferibilmente con laurea su tematica attinente al diritto civile, societario ovvero alla compliance normativa, con votazione di laurea pari o superiore a 100/110;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Abilitazione alla professione legale;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Conoscenza del pacchetto Office (in particolare, degli applicativi Word, Excel e Powerpoint);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Conoscenza della lingua inglese, scritta e parlata. Un’esperienza di studio o lavoro all’estero sarà titolo di preferenza nella valutazione del CV;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Ottime capacità relazionali e di team working;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Flessibilità e dinamicità.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere. All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;em&gt;bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG&lt;/em&gt; - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni concrete&lt;/strong&gt; che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Studio Associato garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;–&lt;em&gt; Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG you’ll have the opportunity to help your firm, clients and colleagues address and resolve some of today’s most topical and complex issues. Our &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Tax &amp;amp; Legal&lt;/strong&gt; professionals work at the forefront of tax and corporate law, delivering integrated and innovative services across all key areas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;As part of the &lt;strong&gt;Legal &amp;amp; Compliance&lt;/strong&gt; team, you’ll help clients navigate corporate law. You’ll be working in a constantly evolving environment, where national and international regulations intersect with market expectations as well as public opinion on crucial topics such as ethics, transparency and corporate governance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;providing advice on civil and corporate law matters, including corporate secretarial activities (preparing board and shareholder&apos; meeting notices, drafting minutes of corporate bodies);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;helping to draft written and oral legal opinions on civil and corporate law matters;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;helping to draft corporate agreements;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;advising on extraordinary transactions (both sides), legal due diligence activities, mergers, demergers and corporate restructurings; acquisitions and disposals of equity interests, businesses and business units; drafting of framework agreements, shareholder agreements, letters of intent, memoranda of understanding and non-disclosure agreements;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;providing regulatory compliance assistance in the development and implementation of models to ensure adherence to regulations in the areas of anti-money laundering; listed companies; antitrust matters; anti-corruption; corporate liability (Legislative Decree no. 231/2001), occupational health and safety, the environment, legality rating and ESG;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;monitoring and analysing regulatory developments, focusing on anti-money laundering (AML), listed company law, corporate criminal liability (under Legislative Decree no. 231/2001), anti-corruption and transparency regulations, antitrust and ESG requirements;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;helping to draft governance regulations and policies, as well as global policies for international groups;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;helping to deliver regulatory compliance training;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;drafting of court filings, providing support in civil and corporate litigation matters, and debt recovery activities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;You’ll be involved in &lt;strong&gt;national and international projects&lt;/strong&gt;,&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;working alongside highly qualified professionals and acquiring top-level skills through interaction with the brightest minds in the field.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Qualifications, Skills and Characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;3-5 years of experience at a leading national or international practice and/or advisory firm;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;a master’s degree in law or business economics – preferably with a dissertation on a topic related to civil or corporate law or regulatory compliance – with a final mark of 100/110 or higher;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;a knowledge of Microsoft Office (in particular, Word, Excel and PowerPoint);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;a knowledge of written and spoken English (study or work experience abroad would be a plus);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;excellent interpersonal and teamwork skills;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;a flexible and dynamic approach.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us – What You’ll Find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive and equitable&lt;/strong&gt; work environment that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;A stimulating and dynamic environment that fosters &lt;strong&gt;creativity &lt;/strong&gt;and &lt;strong&gt;teamworking&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programs to support continuous learning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;international outlook&lt;/strong&gt; and a focus on &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Physical and mental well-being&lt;/strong&gt; initiatives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for each individual, continuous learning, transparency, community engagement, and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG values &lt;/strong&gt;that foster an open environment for the exchange of ideas and knowledge.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;KPMG supports all its people in reaching their full potential, whatever their identity or background. Fully committed to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, we are &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415 compliant &lt;/strong&gt;(ISO 30415:2021 – Human Resources Management – Diversity and Inclusion).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;KPMG in Italy is also &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125 &lt;/strong&gt;compliant (UNI/PdR 125:2022 – measures to ensure gender equality in audit and assurance services). You can find a summary of all our &lt;strong&gt;concrete&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;ESG &lt;/strong&gt;(environmental, social, and governance) &lt;strong&gt;actions&lt;/strong&gt; in our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;here&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG in Italy is an Equal Opportunity Employer&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with Regulation (EU) 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation – “GDPR”) as subsequently amended. For more information, please refer to KPMG’s privacy notice.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;#LI-CN1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Firenze-Senior-Legal-Consultant-Firenze/1368135257/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1368135257</guid><g:id>1368135257</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Legal</g:job_function><g:location>Firenze, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Senior Consultant - Credit Risk Modelling (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:20.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Senior Consultant - Credit Risk Modelling&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;- Your role and responsibilities &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory &lt;/strong&gt;offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitisation, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions. When you join the Financial Risk team in Milan&lt;em&gt;, &lt;/em&gt;you are going to work on &lt;strong&gt;Credit Risk Modelling projects &lt;/strong&gt;for top-tier clients in the energy &amp;amp; utilities sector. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;As part of the  &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Credit Risk Modelling team &lt;/strong&gt;in &lt;strong&gt;Milan&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be responsible for strategic projects. In particular, you will be tasked with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;quantitative analysis using statistical techniques;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;credit risk management based on quantitative aspects:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;development/internal validation of credit risk models under Basel pillar I (PD, LGD, EAD);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;development/internal validation of models under Basel pillar II (economic capital/stress testing);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;database analysis (descriptive statistics – i.e. distribution analysis, mean, variance, etc.);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;development of statistical models (i.e. inferential statistics: regression analysis, discriminant analysis, etc.).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;three to four years of credit risk management experience, ideally gained with specialised consulting companies or top-tier banking or financial institutions;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;previous experience in IFRS9 credit risk modelling and/or credit risk stress testing framework;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;a master’s degree or PhD in statistics, mathematics, engineering, physics or a related field;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;proficiency in English, preferably with study and/or work experience abroad;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;excellent Microsoft Office skills and good knowledge of software for statistical analysis (i.e. &lt;strong&gt;SAS&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;STATA&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;e-views&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;R&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Matlab&lt;/strong&gt;, etc.) and/or programming languages (i.e. &lt;strong&gt;C++,&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;SQL&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;VBA&lt;/strong&gt;, etc.).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable&lt;strong&gt; work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;International mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary ranging from €31,000 to €41,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; - you will find summarised all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social and governance (ESG) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;#LI-FN1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Senior-Consultant-Credit-Risk-Modelling/1368300657/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1368300657</guid><g:id>1368300657</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Risk Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior - Actuarial Services | Milan (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:center;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:20.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Junior Consultant – Actuarial Services| Milano&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:center;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:20.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;L&apos;opportunità di costruire un futuro migliore è proprio davanti a te&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters – Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Desideri intraprendere una professione davvero significativa e d’impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare clienti, azienda e colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. KPMG Advisory offre servizi di consulenza alle imprese per supportarle nella trasformazione del modello di business, nel miglioramento e nella digitalizzazione dei processi, nell’analisi e gestione dei rischi e nelle operazioni di finanza straordinaria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Entrando a far parte del team Actuarial Services di Milano, lavorerai su progetti per clienti di primaria importanza del settore assicurativo.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt&quot;&gt;• &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;IFRS 17, Solvency II, gestione del capitale, supporto nelle operazioni di M&amp;amp;A, data analytics e automazione nell’ambito delle assicurazioni vita;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;• IFRS 17, Solvency II, riserve tecniche, pricing, riassicurazione, pianificazione e data analytics nell’ambito delle assicurazioni danni.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Come As You Are – Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Questa è l’opportunità ideale per te se:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;• possiedi una laurea magistrale in Scienze Statistiche e Attuariali, oppure in Economia con specializzazione in tecniche attuariali, finanza e risk management;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;• hai un’ottima conoscenza della lingua inglese, preferibilmente supportata da esperienze di studio e/o lavoro all’estero;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;• possiedi un’eccellente conoscenza del pacchetto Microsoft Office.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us – Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5pt&quot;&gt;• &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo ed equo che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza la diversità.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;• Un contesto dinamico e stimolante che favorisce creatività e lavoro di squadra.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;• Modalità di lavoro ibride per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita privata e professionale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;• Programmi avanzati di formazione e sviluppo professionale per mantenere competenze sempre aggiornate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;• Mentalità internazionale e partecipazione a progetti innovativi.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;• Iniziative dedicate al benessere mentale e fisico.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio, RAL di ingresso: € 29.000, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi quali il titolo di studio e la valutazione del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro di squadra, rispetto per ogni individuo, apprendimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità e integrità. Questi sono i valori di KPMG, che contribuiscono a creare un ambiente che promuove la condivisione di idee e conoscenze, consentendo ai nostri professionisti di esprimere appieno il proprio potenziale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A conferma del nostro impegno nel promuovere un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo, il nostro Network è conforme ai requisiti della norma ISO 30415 sul Sistema di Gestione della Diversità e Inclusione e della UNI/PdR 125, relativa alla parità di genere.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;All’interno del nostro Impact Plan – Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com) troverai una sintesi di tutte le azioni concrete che stiamo intraprendendo sui temi ambientali, sociali e di governance (ESG).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (Regolamento Generale sulla Protezione dei Dati – “GDPR”), e successive modifiche. Per maggiori informazioni, ti invitiamo a consultare l’informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:15.0pt;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. garantisce pari opportunità a tutti i candidati.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:center;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:20.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:20.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:center;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:20.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Junior Consultant – Actuarial Services| Milan&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:center;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;- Your role and responsibilities &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitisation, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;When you join &lt;span style=&quot;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;the Actuarial Services team in Milan&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;, &lt;/em&gt;you are going to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;work for top-tier clients in the Insurance sector. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;color:#3c3c3c;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;IFRS 17, Solvency II, capital management, support in M&amp;amp;As, data analytics and automation in the life insurance line;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;color:#3c3c3c;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;IFRS 17, Solvency II, reserves, pricing, reinsurance, planning and data analytics in the non-life insurance lines.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 17.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Come As &lt;a name=&quot;_Int_yZQD4mJ8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;You Are - Your skills and characteristics &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:#3c3c3c;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;have a master’s degree in statistical and actuarial sciences, or in business with a specialisation in actuarial techniques, finance and risk management;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:#3c3c3c;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;excellent knowledge of English, preferably with study and/or work experience abroad; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0px;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;color:#3c3c3c;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;excellent knowledge of Microsoft Office.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 17.0pt;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable&lt;strong&gt; work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;International&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary of €29,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;color:windowtext&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; - you will find summarised all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social and governance (ESG) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-FN1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify;line-height:115%;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Junior-Actuarial-Services-Milan/1368263157/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1368263157</guid><g:id>1368263157</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Risk Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Senior M&amp;A Legal Consultant | Milano (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters – Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Are you looking for meaningful and impactful work?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt; At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to support clients, society, and your colleagues in addressing and solving today’s most pressing and complex challenges. The professionals at &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Studio Associato&lt;/strong&gt; operate across all major areas of taxation and corporate law, providing integrated and innovative services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;For the &lt;strong&gt;M&amp;amp;A Legal&lt;/strong&gt; team in the &lt;strong&gt;Milan&lt;/strong&gt; office, we are looking for a professional within the team who will be responsible for activities related to extraordinary corporate transactions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Specifically, will be in charge of:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Legal due diligence activities;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Drafting of contracts related to the completion of acquisition transactions (company and share package acquisitions) and assistance in the various negotiation phases;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Legal assistance in extraordinary transactions and preparation of corporate documentation (mergers, demergers, contributions, corporate reorganizations, etc.);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Preparation of opinions and notes on corporate and commercial matters;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Doctrinal and case law research activities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are – Your Skills and Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;This opportunity is perfect for you if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;At least 3 years experience in a leading firms or Legal consulting;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Master&apos;s degree in Law with a grade higher than 105/110;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Excellent knowledge of the English language;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Excellent knowledge of the Office package;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Excellent interpersonal and team working skills;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Flexibility and dynamism.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working With Us Also Means&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Ongoing professional development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;A clearly defined career growth path&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us – What You’ll Find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive and equitable&lt;/strong&gt; work environment that respects, encourages, and values diversity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;stimulating and dynamic&lt;/strong&gt; setting that promotes creativity and teamwork&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced training and development programs&lt;/strong&gt; to stay up to date&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;international mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and a focus on innovative projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;physical and mental well-being&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;– Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;environment&lt;/strong&gt;, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt;bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt; - you will find summarised all the &lt;strong&gt;concrete actions&lt;/strong&gt; we are taking on environmental, social and governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Studio Associato is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;#LI-CN1  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Senior-M&amp;A-Legal-Consultant-Milano/1365618257/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1365618257</guid><g:id>1365618257</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Legal</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Deal Advisory M&amp;A Tax Consultant | Milano (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your role and responsibilities&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the firm and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. The tax and legal experts at KPMG &lt;strong&gt;Studio Associato &lt;/strong&gt;provide assistance in all the key tax and corporate law areas, offering innovative, integrated services.&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;In particular, by joining the &lt;strong&gt;Deal Advisory M&amp;amp;A Tax Team &lt;/strong&gt;of our Milan office, you will help support clients in addressing challenges related to key areas of taxation. You will operate in a constantly evolving scenario, where national and international regulations intertwine with market and public opinion expectations on crucial topics such as ethics, transparency, and corporate governance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Specifically you will be tasked with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tax due diligence reviews of extraordinary transactions (mergers, demergers, acquisitions, contributions, etc);&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Corporate restructuring;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Analyses of the treatment of extraordinary transactions according to national accounting standards (OIC) and international ones (IAS/IFRS);&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;National and International tax opinions;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Applications for tax rulings;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Preparation of corporate income tax returns (Modello Unico and Modello IRAP).&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;You will be involved in &lt;strong&gt;national&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;international projects&lt;/strong&gt;, working alongside highly qualified professionals and acquiring top-level skills through interaction with the brightest minds in the field.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As &lt;a name=&quot;_Int_yZQD4mJ8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;You Are - &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your skills and characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;0-3 years of professional experience at International Law Firms, the Big Four and/or Advisory Firms;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;A master’s degree in &lt;strong&gt;Economics&lt;/strong&gt; (LM-77 or LM-56) or &lt;strong&gt;Law&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;(LMG-01), &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;with a final grade of at least 100/110;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The intention to pursue the &lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;professional practice&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;as a&lt;strong&gt; C&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;hartered Accountant&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;o&lt;strong&gt;r Lawyer&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;A good knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;Microsoft Office&lt;/strong&gt;, especially Excel and PowerPoint;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Excellent &lt;strong&gt;interpersonal&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable &lt;strong&gt;work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;– Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;environment&lt;/strong&gt;, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt;bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt; - you will find summarised all the &lt;strong&gt;concrete actions&lt;/strong&gt; we are taking on environmental, social and governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Studio Associato is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;#LI-CN1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Milano-Deal-Advisory-M&amp;A-Tax-Consultant-Milano/1365619457/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1365619457</guid><g:id>1365619457</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Tax</g:job_function><g:location>Milano, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior Consultant  IT Strategy | CIO Advisory (Verona, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;- Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. Gli esperti di &lt;strong&gt;Nolan Norton&lt;/strong&gt;, società di IT Strategy del Network KPMG, aiutano le organizzazioni ad affrontare le sfide di trasformazione digitale e ad implementare architetture IT. In particolare, entrerai a far parte del Team CIO Advisory di Bologna, esperto di architetture e soluzioni di data management che supporta i CIO nell&apos;evoluzione digitale del loro percorso, nel loro journey verso il cloud, dalla strategia all&apos;esecuzione e dalla visione al valore reale. Entrerai a far parte di un ambiente dinamico e stimolante, per clienti di alto livello altamente visibili nei mercati dei servizi finanziari, dell&apos;energia, del settore pubblico e dei consumatori e industriali.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di su tecnologie innovative su progetti sfidanti ed entusiasmanti, supportando i nostri clienti principalmente sulle seguenti tematiche:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;: aiutiamo i nostri clienti a sviluppare strategie tecnologiche e modelli operativi tecnologici innovativi;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Architecture&lt;/strong&gt;: consentiamo ai clienti di utilizzare soluzioni all&apos;avanguardia per applicazioni, infrastrutture e TLC;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Management&lt;/strong&gt;: aiutiamo i nostri clienti nell’identificazione delle migliori soluzioni di gestione del dato e progettazione di architetture di Data Management;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Planning &amp;amp; Budgeting&lt;/strong&gt;: assistiamo i nostri clienti a identificare, definire le priorità, progettare e indirizzare meglio gli investimenti tecnologici;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Sourcing&lt;/strong&gt;: gestiamo la governance e svolgiamo attività di supporto tecnico durante la selezione delle varie opzioni e dei fornitori nell&apos;intero ciclo dei servizi ICT;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Governance and Organization&lt;/strong&gt;: ci occupiamo della corretta struttura e dimensionamento delle risorse ICT;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Cost right-sizing&lt;/strong&gt;: valutiamo e suggeriamo opzioni per indirizzare meglio la spesa e le risorse ICT.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Laurea Magistrale in Ingegneria Gestionale,Informatica, Elettronica, delle Telecomunicazioni, Fisica, Matematica;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Conoscenza della lingua inglese, idealmente approfondita attraverso un&apos;esperienza formativa/lavorativa all&apos;estero.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida,&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Opportunità di stage con indennità mensile di 800€ per stage curriculare o 1000€ per stage extracurriculare &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni concrete&lt;/strong&gt; che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Nolan Norton Spa garantisce le pari opportunità&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, society, and colleagues tackle and solve the most current and complex challenges. Experts from Nolan Norton, an IT Strategy company within the KPMG Network, help organizations face digital transformation challenges and implement IT architectures. Specifically, you will join the CIO Advisory Team, experts in data management architectures and solutions that support CIOs in their digital evolution journey, from strategy to execution and from vision to real value. You will be part of a dynamic and stimulating environment, working with high-level clients highly visible in the financial services, energy, public sector, and consumer and industrial markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will work on innovative technologies on challenging and exciting projects, supporting our clients mainly on the following topics:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;: We help our clients develop innovative technology strategies and operating models;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Architecture&lt;/strong&gt;: We enable clients to use cutting-edge solutions for applications, infrastructure, and TLC;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Management&lt;/strong&gt;: We help our clients identify the best data management solutions and design data management architectures;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Planning &amp;amp; Budgeting&lt;/strong&gt;: We assist our clients in identifying, prioritizing, designing, and better directing technology investments;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Sourcing&lt;/strong&gt;: We manage governance and provide technical support during the selection of various options and suppliers throughout the ICT services cycle;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Governance and Organization&lt;/strong&gt;: We take care of the proper structure and sizing of ICT resources;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Cost Right-Sizing&lt;/strong&gt;: We evaluate and suggest options to better direct ICT spending and resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are - Your Skills and Characteristics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Master&apos;s degree in Management Engineering, Computer Engineering, Electronic Engineering, Telecommunications Engineering, Physics, Mathematics;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Knowledge of the English language, ideally deepened through educational/work experience abroad.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us - What You Will Find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An inclusive, fair work environment that respects, encourages, and values diversity;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A stimulating and dynamic context that encourages creativity and teamwork;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hybrid work mode to promote a healthy work-life balance;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced training and development programs to stay always updated;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;International mindset and innovative projects;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on physical and mental well-being.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Paid internship opportunity offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community, integrity: these are the Values of KPMG that create an environment open to the exchange of ideas and knowledge, allowing our professionals to express their full potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Within our Impact Plan - Our Impact Plan - you will find a summary of all the concrete actions we are carrying out on environmental, social, and governance (ESG) issues. Join us! Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) No. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) and subsequent amendments. For more information, please refer to the KPMG privacy policy. Nolan Norton Spa guarantees equal opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-SD1&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Verona-Junior-Consultant-IT-Strategy-CIO-Advisory/1370797757/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1370797757</guid><g:id>1370797757</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Verona, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior Consultant IT Strategy | CIO Advisory (Roma, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;- Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. Gli esperti di &lt;strong&gt;Nolan Norton&lt;/strong&gt;, società di IT Strategy del Network KPMG, aiutano le organizzazioni ad affrontare le sfide di trasformazione digitale e ad implementare architetture IT. In particolare, entrerai a far parte del Team CIO Advisory di Roma, esperto di architetture e soluzioni di data management che supporta i CIO nell&apos;evoluzione digitale del loro percorso, nel loro journey verso il cloud, dalla strategia all&apos;esecuzione e dalla visione al valore reale. Entrerai a far parte di un ambiente dinamico e stimolante, per clienti di alto livello altamente visibili nei mercati dei servizi finanziari, dell&apos;energia, del settore pubblico e dei consumatori e industriali.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di su tecnologie innovative su progetti sfidanti ed entusiasmanti, supportando i nostri clienti principalmente sulle seguenti tematiche:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;: aiutiamo i nostri clienti a sviluppare strategie tecnologiche e modelli operativi tecnologici innovativi;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Architecture&lt;/strong&gt;: consentiamo ai clienti di utilizzare soluzioni all&apos;avanguardia per applicazioni, infrastrutture e TLC;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Management&lt;/strong&gt;: aiutiamo i nostri clienti nell’identificazione delle migliori soluzioni di gestione del dato e progettazione di architetture di Data Management;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Planning &amp;amp; Budgeting&lt;/strong&gt;: assistiamo i nostri clienti a identificare, definire le priorità, progettare e indirizzare meglio gli investimenti tecnologici;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Sourcing&lt;/strong&gt;: gestiamo la governance e svolgiamo attività di supporto tecnico durante la selezione delle varie opzioni e dei fornitori nell&apos;intero ciclo dei servizi ICT;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Governance and Organization&lt;/strong&gt;: ci occupiamo della corretta struttura e dimensionamento delle risorse ICT;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Cost right-sizing&lt;/strong&gt;: valutiamo e suggeriamo opzioni per indirizzare meglio la spesa e le risorse ICT.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Laurea Magistrale in Ingegneria Gestionale,Informatica, Elettronica, delle Telecomunicazioni, Fisica, Matematica;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Conoscenza della lingua inglese, idealmente approfondita attraverso un&apos;esperienza formativa/lavorativa all&apos;estero.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida,&lt;/strong&gt; per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Opportunità di stage con indennità mensile di 800€ per stage curriculare o 1000€ per stage extracurriculare &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni concrete&lt;/strong&gt; che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Nolan Norton Spa garantisce le pari opportunità&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, society, and colleagues tackle and solve the most current and complex challenges. Experts from Nolan Norton, an IT Strategy company within the KPMG Network, help organizations face digital transformation challenges and implement IT architectures. Specifically, you will join the CIO Advisory Team, experts in data management architectures and solutions that support CIOs in their digital evolution journey, from strategy to execution and from vision to real value. You will be part of a dynamic and stimulating environment, working with high-level clients highly visible in the financial services, energy, public sector, and consumer and industrial markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will work on innovative technologies on challenging and exciting projects, supporting our clients mainly on the following topics:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;: We help our clients develop innovative technology strategies and operating models;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Architecture&lt;/strong&gt;: We enable clients to use cutting-edge solutions for applications, infrastructure, and TLC;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Management&lt;/strong&gt;: We help our clients identify the best data management solutions and design data management architectures;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Planning &amp;amp; Budgeting&lt;/strong&gt;: We assist our clients in identifying, prioritizing, designing, and better directing technology investments;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Sourcing&lt;/strong&gt;: We manage governance and provide technical support during the selection of various options and suppliers throughout the ICT services cycle;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Governance and Organization&lt;/strong&gt;: We take care of the proper structure and sizing of ICT resources;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICT Cost Right-Sizing&lt;/strong&gt;: We evaluate and suggest options to better direct ICT spending and resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are - Your Skills and Characteristics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Master&apos;s degree in Management Engineering, Computer Engineering, Electronic Engineering, Telecommunications Engineering, Physics, Mathematics;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Knowledge of the English language, ideally deepened through educational/work experience abroad.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us - What You Will Find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;An inclusive, fair work environment that respects, encourages, and values diversity;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;A stimulating and dynamic context that encourages creativity and teamwork;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hybrid work mode to promote a healthy work-life balance;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Advanced training and development programs to stay always updated;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;International mindset and innovative projects;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on physical and mental well-being.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Paid internship opportunity offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community, integrity: these are the Values of KPMG that create an environment open to the exchange of ideas and knowledge, allowing our professionals to express their full potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Within our Impact Plan - Our Impact Plan - you will find a summary of all the concrete actions we are carrying out on environmental, social, and governance (ESG) issues. Join us! Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) No. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) and subsequent amendments. For more information, please refer to the KPMG privacy policy. Nolan Norton Spa guarantees equal opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 8.0pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-DM1&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Roma-Junior-Consultant-IT-Strategy-CIO-Advisory/1368450057/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1368450057</guid><g:id>1368450057</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Roma, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Senior Consultant -  AMS SAP FI-CO (Napoli, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNoSpacing&quot; style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNoSpacing&quot; style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;KPMG Open Platform è il nostro nuovo Hub innovativo con sede a Napoli, creato per sviluppare modelli di servizio e soluzioni ad alto contenuto tecnologico per le imprese e la Pubblica Amministrazione. Le aree di intervento includono Cyber Security, Program Management su grandi cantieri di trasformazione del settore pubblico, Application Maintenance e Managed Services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Entrando a far parte del &lt;strong&gt;Team AMS SAP&lt;/strong&gt;, sarai impegnata/o nella gestione dei processi aziendali relativi al modulo &lt;strong&gt;SAP FI-CO&lt;/strong&gt;, con un focus su manutenzione, ottimizzazione e personalizzazione delle piattaforme SAP.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Analizzare i processi aziendali relativi all&apos;area amministrazione, finanza e controllo, identificando opportunità di miglioramento e definendo le priorità di intervento in collaborazione con il management;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Progettare e implementare soluzioni SAP FI/CO personalizzate per ottimizzare i processi di contabilità generale, contabilità fornitori e clienti, cespiti, controlling e reporting gestionale;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Supervisionare la manutenzione correttiva ed evolutiva dei moduli SAP FI/CO, garantendo la corretta integrazione con gli altri moduli SAP (es. MM, SD, PP);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Affiancare e supportare le risorse junior, favorendone la crescita professionale attraverso formazione on the job e condivisione delle best practice&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Avrai l’opportunità di crescere professionalmente e affrontare sfide stimolanti, partecipando a progetti che mirano ad aiutare i prestigiosi clienti del nostro network in particolare su contesti&lt;strong&gt; Industrial &amp;amp; Manufacturing &lt;/strong&gt;(es. Automotive, Industrial Manufacturing, Food &amp;amp; Drink, Consumer Products, Pharmaceutical &amp;amp; Life Sciences). &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai maturato almeno &lt;strong&gt;1-2&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;anni di esperienza&lt;/strong&gt; in ambito SAP, con un focus sul modulo SAP FI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hai maturato esperienza diretta nella &lt;strong&gt;gestione del ciclo di vita dei progetti AMS&lt;/strong&gt;, dalla presa in carico delle richieste fino alla chiusura, con capacità di monitorare SLA e qualità degli output; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Possiedi capacità di identificare e&lt;strong&gt; risolvere rapidamente problematiche tecniche&lt;/strong&gt; e funzionali all&apos;interno del modulo SAP FI-CO, utilizzando metodologie di troubleshooting efficaci, e sai guidare il team nella gestione delle criticità;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Sei abituata/o a lavorare in ambienti strutturati dimostrando &lt;strong&gt;autonomia operativa&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us – Cosa troverai in KPMG Open Platform&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le diversità;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la creatività e il lavoro di squadra;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro ibrida, per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Programmi di formazione e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Mindset internazionale e progettualità innovative;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul benessere psicofisico;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Un’organizzazione che si impegna per generare un impatto sociale e sul territorio.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio, RAL indicativa compresa tra € 24.500 e € 31.500 per la qualifica di Junior Analyst/Analyst, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi con riferimento specifico alle competenze e all’esperienza del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i Valori di KPMG che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di esprimere tutto il loro potenziale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; (Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione) e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt; (parità di genere). All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan – bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG&lt;/strong&gt; trovi riassunte tutte le azioni concrete che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (ESG).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;KPMG Open Platform S.r.l SB garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters – Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG you will have the opportunity to help clients, society, and your colleagues face and solve the most current and complex challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;KPMG Open Platform is our new innovation hub based in Naples, created to develop high-tech service models and solutions for businesses and the Public Administration. Areas of focus include Cyber Security, Program Management on large public sector transformation projects, Application Maintenance and Managed Services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;By joining the AMS SAP Team, you will be involved in managing business processes related to the SAP FI-CO module, with a focus on maintenance, optimization and customization of SAP platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be responsible for:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analyze&lt;/strong&gt; business processes related to &lt;strong&gt;Finance, Accounting, and Controlling&lt;/strong&gt;, identifying opportunities for improvement and defining implementation priorities in collaboration with management;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design and implement&lt;/strong&gt; customized &lt;strong&gt;SAP FI/CO&lt;/strong&gt; solutions to optimize &lt;strong&gt;General Ledger (GL), Accounts Payable (AP), Accounts Receivable (AR), Asset Accounting (AA), Controlling (CO), and Management Reporting&lt;/strong&gt; processes;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Oversee&lt;/strong&gt; the corrective and evolutive maintenance of &lt;strong&gt;SAP FI/CO&lt;/strong&gt; modules, ensuring seamless integration with other SAP modules (e.g., &lt;strong&gt;MM, SD, PP&lt;/strong&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coach and support&lt;/strong&gt; junior team members, fostering their professional growth through on-the-job training and the sharing of best practices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You will have the opportunity to grow professionally and take on stimulating challenges, working on projects aimed at supporting our network&apos;s leading clients, particularly in Industrial &amp;amp; Manufacturing contexts (e.g. Automotive, Industrial Manufacturing, Food &amp;amp; Drink, Consumer Products, Pharmaceutical &amp;amp; Life Sciences).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are – Your Skills and Characteristics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;This opportunity is perfect for you if:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have gained at least 1-2 years of experience in SAP, with a focus on the SAP FI module;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You have direct experience managing the AMS project lifecycle, from request intake through to closure, with the ability to monitor SLAs and output quality;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You are able to quickly identify and resolve technical and functional issues within the SAP FI-CO module using effective troubleshooting methodologies, and can guide the team in managing critical situations;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;You are used to working in structured environments, demonstrating operational autonomy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us – What You Will Find at KPMG Open Platform&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;An inclusive, equitable workplace that respects, encourages and values diversity;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;A stimulating and dynamic environment that fosters creativity and teamwork;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Hybrid working arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Advanced training and development programs to stay continuously up to date;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;An international mindset and innovative projects;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on physical and mental wellbeing;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;An organization committed to generating social and community impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary ranging from €24,500 to €31,500 for the Junior analyst/analyst position. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for every individual, continuous learning, transparency, community engagement, integrity: these are KPMG&apos;s Values, which give life to an environment open to the exchange of ideas and knowledge, allowing our professionals to express their full potential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Thanks to our commitment to fostering an inclusive workplace, our Network complies with the standards of ISO 30415 (Diversity and Inclusion Management System) and UNI PdR 125 (gender equality). Within our Impact Plan – bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG you will find a summary of all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social and governance (ESG) issues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt;color:black&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) No. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation – &quot;GDPR&quot;) and subsequent amendments. For further information, please consult KPMG&apos;s privacy policy. KPMG Open Platform S.r.l SB guarantees equal opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;#LI-EB1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Napoli-Senior-Consultant-AMS-SAP-FI-CO/1368451157/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1368451157</guid><g:id>1368451157</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Napoli, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Stage Transfer Pricing | Firenze (Firenze, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stage Transfer Pricing | Firenze&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. I professionisti dello &lt;strong&gt;Studio Associato&lt;/strong&gt; di KPMG intervengono in tutte le principali aree della fiscalità e del diritto societario offrendo servizi integrati e innovativi.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;In particolare, entrando a far parte del &lt;strong&gt;Team Transfer Pricing &lt;/strong&gt;di &lt;strong&gt;Firenze&lt;/strong&gt;, contribuirai a supportare i clienti nell&apos;affrontare le sfide legate alle principali aree della fiscalità. Opererai in uno scenario in continua evoluzione, dove normative nazionali e internazionali si intrecciano con le aspettative del mercato e dell’opinione pubblica su temi cruciali come l’etica, la trasparenza e la corporate governance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Nello specifico, ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Strutturare ed eseguire analisi di conformità alla normativa fiscale italiana e alle linee guida OCSE;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Analizzare la catena del valore dei gruppi attraverso interviste al management;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Analizzare bilanci e contratti infragruppo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Eseguire analisi economiche e di benchmarking;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Redigere la documentazione sul transfer pricing;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Sviluppare competenze in materia di fiscalità internazionale e dei gruppi.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Questa è l’opportunità perfetta per te se hai:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Laurea magistrale in discipline economiche;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Disponibilità a conseguire l’abilitazione come Dottore Commercialista;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Ottima conoscenza della lingua inglese;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Ottima conoscenza del pacchetto Microsoft Office;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Ottime capacità relazionali e attitudine al lavoro di squadra;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Spiccate capacità organizzative, spirito d’iniziativa e problem solving;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Approccio flessibile e dinamico.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt; Sarà considerato un plus un Master di II livello in Diritto Tributario.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Il tuo futuro con noi – Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Opportunità di stage con indennità mensile di 1000€ per stage curriculare o 1200€ per stage extracurriculare;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt; ed &lt;strong&gt;equo&lt;/strong&gt;, che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza la &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Un contesto &lt;strong&gt;sfidante e dinamico&lt;/strong&gt; che favorisce la creatività e il lavoro di squadra;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione e sviluppo&lt;/strong&gt; avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Un mindset internazionale e &lt;strong&gt;progetti innovativi&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Iniziative dedicate al &lt;strong&gt;benessere mentale e fisico&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Insieme per un futuro migliore – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro di squadra, rispetto per ogni individuo, apprendimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità e integrità. Questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che creano un ambiente in cui è possibile condividere idee e conoscenze affinché i nostri professionisti possano &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere. All&apos;interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; – [Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)] – sono sintetizzate tutte le azioni concrete che stiamo portando avanti in materia ambientale, sociale e di governance (ESG).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), come modificato. Per ulteriori informazioni, consulta l’informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Studio Associato è un datore di lavoro che offre pari opportunità.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transfer Pricing Intern | Florence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your role and responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;With its highly qualified tax and legal experts, &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Studio Associato&lt;/strong&gt; provides assistance in all the key tax and corporate law areas, offering innovative, integrated services. Its work teams specialise in both professional field and client sector. With over &lt;strong&gt;600 professionals &lt;/strong&gt;at &lt;strong&gt;12 offices &lt;/strong&gt;in Italy&apos;s largest cities, the KPMG network&apos;s Tax and legal unit is one of the top professional partnerships in the country.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt; We are recruiting a professional to join our &lt;strong&gt;Transfer Pricing&lt;/strong&gt; team in &lt;strong&gt;Florence&lt;/strong&gt;, who will perform international tax analyses to establish the transfer prices of goods, services and financial transactions between companies in the same industrial or financial group, in order to determine the proper tax base in each tax jurisdiction in which the group operates.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt; Specifically, the successful candidate will be tasked with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Structuring and performing compliance analyses with Italian tax legislation and the OECD guidelines;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Analysing the value chain of groups by interviewing management;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Analysing financial statements and intragroup contracts;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Performance of economic and benchmarking analysis;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Drafting of transfer pricing documentation;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Developing skills in international tax matters.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Master’s degree in business (LM-56 and LM-77);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Willingness to obtain such qualification as a chartered accountant;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Excellent knowledge of English;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Excellent knowledge of Microsoft Office, especially Excel;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Excellent interpersonal and teamwork skills;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Strong organizational skills, initiative and problem solving;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Flexible and dynamic approach.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt; A post-graduate specialisation in Tax Law would be a definite plus.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Paid internship opportunity offering a monthly allowance of €1,000 for curricular internships and €1200 for extracurricular internships&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive &lt;/strong&gt;and equitable &lt;strong&gt;work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages &lt;strong&gt;creativity &lt;/strong&gt;and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training &lt;/strong&gt;and development programmes to stay current.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and&lt;strong&gt; innovative projects&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG values&lt;/strong&gt; that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - you will find summarised all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social and governance (ESG) issues.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPMG Studio Associato is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LI-CN1&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Firenze-Stage-Transfer-Pricing-Firenze/1368569457/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1368569457</guid><g:id>1368569457</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Tax</g:job_function><g:location>Firenze, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior Analyst AMS SAP Finance (Napoli, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNoSpacing&quot; style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNoSpacing&quot; style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; avrai l&apos;opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; offre servizi di consulenza alle imprese per affiancarle nella trasformazione del business model, nel miglioramento e nella digitalizzazione dei processi, nell&apos;analisi e nella gestione dei rischi, nonché supporto nelle operazioni di finanza straordinaria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;In particolare, entrando a far parte del &lt;strong&gt;Team AMS SAP FI&lt;/strong&gt;, sarai impegnata/o nella &lt;strong&gt;gestione continuativa e nell&apos;evoluzione dei sistemi SAP&lt;/strong&gt; già attivi presso i nostri clienti, con focus sui processi di &lt;strong&gt;contabilità e finanza aziendale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Nello specifico ti occuperai di:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Supportare la &lt;strong&gt;gestione dei ticket&lt;/strong&gt; (segnalazioni di anomalie e richieste di supporto) provenienti dagli utenti dei sistemi SAP FI dei clienti&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Analizzare le &lt;strong&gt;cause delle anomalie segnalate&lt;/strong&gt;, individuando le soluzioni più adatte a ripristinare il corretto funzionamento del sistema&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Supportare l&apos;implementazione di &lt;strong&gt;evolutive&lt;/strong&gt;, ovvero piccole modifiche o miglioramenti al sistema richiesti dal cliente per adattarlo a nuove esigenze&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Contribuire alla &lt;strong&gt;documentazione tecnica e funzionale&lt;/strong&gt; relativa alle attività svolte e alle soluzioni implementate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Monitorare il corretto funzionamento dei &lt;strong&gt;processi di contabilità e finanza&lt;/strong&gt; gestiti a sistema, segnalando eventuali criticità&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Collaborare con il team di progetto per garantire la &lt;strong&gt;continuità operativa&lt;/strong&gt; dei sistemi in gestione&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Hai un percorso accademico in &lt;strong&gt;Economia o Management&lt;/strong&gt;, oppure un altro percorso di studi (laurea o diploma) integrato da un &lt;strong&gt;corso di formazione SAP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Hai particolare interesse per le tematiche di &lt;strong&gt;contabilità, finanza aziendale e amministrazione&lt;/strong&gt;, maturato anche solo attraverso il percorso di studi, la tesi o esperienze formative&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Ti incuriosisce il mondo dei &lt;strong&gt;sistemi informativi gestionali&lt;/strong&gt; e della loro &lt;strong&gt;manutenzione ed evoluzione&lt;/strong&gt; nel tempo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Hai buone capacità di &lt;strong&gt;analisi e problem solving&lt;/strong&gt;, utili a individuare la causa di un&apos;anomalia e la soluzione più adatta&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Ti piace lavorare &lt;strong&gt;in gruppo&lt;/strong&gt;, metterti in gioco e affrontare sfide sempre nuove&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Hai una &lt;strong&gt;buona conoscenza della lingua inglese&lt;/strong&gt;, meglio se avvalorata da un&apos;esperienza di studio e/o lavoro all&apos;estero&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;inclusivo, equo&lt;/strong&gt; e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le diversità&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Un contesto &lt;strong&gt;stimolante e dinamico&lt;/strong&gt; che incentiva la creatività e il lavoro di squadra&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Modalità di lavoro &lt;strong&gt;ibrida&lt;/strong&gt;, per promuovere un sano equilibrio tra vita lavorativa e personale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione e sviluppo avanzati&lt;/strong&gt; per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Mindset &lt;strong&gt;internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e progettualità innovative&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;L&apos;opportunità prevede un inserimento in stage o in assunzione con inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio e RAL di ingresso € 23.500, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi quali il titolo di studio e la valutazione del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i Valori di KPMG che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di esprimere tutto il loro potenziale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Grazie all&apos;impegno nel favorire un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l&apos;Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere. All&apos;interno del nostro Impact Plan - Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com) - trovi riassunte tutte le azioni concrete che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;K&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;PMG Advisory S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Do you want to do work that truly matters and makes an impact? At &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;, you will have the opportunity to help clients, society, and colleagues face and solve today&apos;s most current and complex challenges. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; provides consulting services to businesses, supporting them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitalisation, risk analysis and management, as well as extraordinary finance operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;In particular, joining the &lt;strong&gt;AMS SAP FI Team&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be involved in the &lt;strong&gt;ongoing management and evolution of SAP systems&lt;/strong&gt; already in use by our clients, with a focus on &lt;strong&gt;accounting and corporate finance&lt;/strong&gt; processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Support the &lt;strong&gt;management of tickets&lt;/strong&gt; (issue reports and support requests) submitted by users of clients&apos; SAP FI systems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Analyse the &lt;strong&gt;root causes of reported issues&lt;/strong&gt;, identifying the most suitable solutions to restore correct system functioning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Support the implementation of &lt;strong&gt;enhancements&lt;/strong&gt;, i.e. small changes or improvements to the system requested by the client to adapt it to new business needs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Contribute to &lt;strong&gt;technical and functional documentation&lt;/strong&gt; relating to activities carried out and solutions implemented&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Monitor the correct functioning of &lt;strong&gt;accounting and finance processes&lt;/strong&gt; managed through the system, flagging any issues&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Collaborate with the project team to ensure the &lt;strong&gt;operational continuity&lt;/strong&gt; of the systems being managed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are - Your Skills and Qualities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;This opportunity is right for you if:ù&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;You hold a degree in &lt;strong&gt;Economics or Management&lt;/strong&gt;, or another academic background (degree or diploma) complemented by a &lt;strong&gt;SAP training course&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;You have a particular interest in &lt;strong&gt;accounting, corporate finance, and administration&lt;/strong&gt; topics, gained through your studies, thesis, or training experiences&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;You are curious about the world of &lt;strong&gt;management information systems&lt;/strong&gt; and their &lt;strong&gt;maintenance and evolution&lt;/strong&gt; over time&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;You have good &lt;strong&gt;analytical and problem-solving skills&lt;/strong&gt;, useful for identifying the root cause of an issue and the most suitable solution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;You enjoy working &lt;strong&gt;as part of a team&lt;/strong&gt;, putting yourself forward, and taking on new challenges&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;You have a &lt;strong&gt;good command of English&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally supported by a study and/or work experience abroad&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us - What You Will Find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive and equitable&lt;/strong&gt; work environment that respects, encourages, and values diversity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;stimulating and dynamic&lt;/strong&gt; setting that fosters creativity and teamwork&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;hybrid working&lt;/strong&gt; model to support a healthy work-life balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training and development&lt;/strong&gt; programmes to keep you always up to date&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;international mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and innovative projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;physical and mental wellbeing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;This opportunity is offered as either an internship or a standard employment contract under the &lt;strong&gt;collective labour agreement for the commerce sector&lt;/strong&gt;, with a &lt;strong&gt;starting gross annual salary of €23,500&lt;/strong&gt;. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate&apos;s profile against the requirements of the role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our Values and Our Commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;, teamwork, respect for every individual, continuous learning, transparency, community engagement, and integrity: these are the Values of KPMG, which give life to an environment open to the exchange of ideas and knowledge, enabling our professionals to reach their full potential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;Through our commitment to fostering an inclusive workplace, our Network complies with the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; standard (Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion Management System) and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt; (Gender Equality). Within our Impact Plan - Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com) - you will find a full overview of the concrete actions we are taking on &lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt; (Environmental, Social, and Governance) topics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with EU Regulation No. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) and subsequent amendments. For further information, please refer to KPMG&apos;s privacy policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunities employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;#LI-MM2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Napoli-Junior-Analyst-AMS-SAP-Finance/1368518857/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1368518857</guid><g:id>1368518857</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Napoli, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Legal Public Sector Consultant | Roma (Roma, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Legal Public Sector Consultant | Roma&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;center&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. I professionisti dello &lt;strong&gt;Studio Associato&lt;/strong&gt; di KPMG intervengono in tutte le principali aree della fiscalità e del diritto societario offrendo servizi integrati e innovativi.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;In particolare, entrando a far parte del &lt;strong&gt;Team Legal Public Sector &lt;/strong&gt; di &lt;strong&gt;Roma&lt;/strong&gt; contribuirai a supportare i clienti nell&apos;affrontare le sfide legate alle principali aree del diritto societario. Opererai in uno scenario in continua evoluzione, dove normative nazionali e internazionali si intrecciano con le aspettative del mercato e dell’opinione pubblica su temi cruciali come l’etica, la trasparenza e la corporate governance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Ricerchiamo professionisti che si occuperanno di attività relative al diritto dei contratti pubblici, alle previsioni in materia di anticorruzione e trasparenza, e ai profili di informatizzazione della P.A. (C.A.D.). In particolare, le attività saranno rese in favore di &lt;strong&gt;Pubbliche Amministrazioni&lt;/strong&gt; e organismi assimilabili, e riguarderanno le seguenti discipline e aree tematiche:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Contratti pubblici di lavori, servizi e forniture (D.Lgs. 36/2023)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Pubblica Amministrazione digitale, e-procurement, e-health, e in generale digitalizzazione dei procedimenti amministrativi e della loro gestione documentale (D.Lgs. 82/2005)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Obblighi normativi in materia di anticorruzione e trasparenza (l. 190/2012 e D.Lgs. 33/2013)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Sarai coinvolta/o su &lt;strong&gt;progetti nazionali &lt;/strong&gt;e&lt;strong&gt; internazionali, &lt;/strong&gt;lavorando al fianco di professioniste e professionisti altamente qualificati e acquisendo competenze di primo livello attraverso il confronto con le menti più brillanti del settore.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As &lt;a name=&quot;_Int_yZQD4mJ8&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Questa opportunità è perfetta per te se:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Hai conseguito la Laurea in &lt;strong&gt;Giurisprudenza&lt;/strong&gt; (LMG-01) con votazione almeno pari a 105/110;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Hai maturato esperienza professionale mirata di almeno 4 anni;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Hai conseguito l&apos;abilitazione all&apos;esercizio della professione forense;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Buona conoscenza di Office, in particolare Excel e Power Point&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ottime capacità relazionali e di team working&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Un ambiente di &lt;strong&gt;lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, equo e che rispetta, incoraggia e valorizza le &lt;strong&gt;diversità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Un contesto stimolante e dinamico che incentiva la &lt;strong&gt;creatività&lt;/strong&gt; e il &lt;strong&gt;lavoro di squadra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Programmi di &lt;strong&gt;formazione&lt;/strong&gt; e sviluppo avanzati per rimanere sempre aggiornati&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; internazionale&lt;/strong&gt; e &lt;strong&gt;progettualità innovative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Iniziative incentrate sul &lt;strong&gt;benessere psicofisico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network risulta conforme agli standard dei requisiti &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, sul Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relativa alla parità di genere. All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt;bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt; - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni concrete&lt;/strong&gt; che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Studio Associato garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Legal Public Sector Consultant | Rome&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do Work That Matters – Your Role and Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Are you looking for meaningful and impactful work? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to support clients, society, and your colleagues in addressing and solving today’s most pressing and complex challenges. The professionals at KPMG Studio Associato operate across all major areas of taxation and corporate law, providing integrated and innovative services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;We are looking for a professional to join the &lt;strong&gt;Legal Public Sector team &lt;/strong&gt;to carry out activities relating to public procurement law and anti-bribery and transparency requirements. Specifically, these activities will be carried out with the public administration and similar bodies in respect of the following fields and areas:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;public works, service and supply contracts (Legislative decree no. 36/2023);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;the digital public administration, e-procurement, e-health and, in general, the digitalisation of administrative procedures and the management of the related documentation (Legislative decree no. 82/2005);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;obligations pursuant to anti-bribery and transparency regulations (Law no. 190/2012 and Legislative decree no. 33/2013);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come As You Are – Your Skills and Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;This opportunity is perfect for you if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;a master&apos;s degree in law with final marks of at least 105/110;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;experience with large law firms, state-owned companies or public bodies in one or more of the subjects relevant to this notice;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;already be practising as a lawyer or be certified to practice as a lawyer;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;a good knowledge of Microsoft Office;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;excellent interpersonal and teamwork skills;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;excellent organisational skills, an ability to take initiative and problem solving abilities;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;strong motivation to grow professionally;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;flexible and dynamic approach.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working With Us Also Means&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Ongoing professional development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;A clearly defined career growth path&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Future With Us – What You’ll Find at KPMG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive and equitable&lt;/strong&gt; work environment that respects, encourages, and values diversity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;stimulating and dynamic&lt;/strong&gt; setting that promotes creativity and teamwork&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced training and development programs&lt;/strong&gt; to stay up to date&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;international mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and a focus on innovative projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;physical and mental well-being&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;– Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;environment&lt;/strong&gt;, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;em&gt;&lt;span&gt;bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt; - you will find summarised all the &lt;strong&gt;concrete actions&lt;/strong&gt; we are taking on environmental, social and governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Studio Associato is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;#LI-CN1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Roma-Legal-Public-Sector-Consultant-Roma/1368528657/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1368528657</guid><g:id>1368528657</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Legal</g:job_function><g:location>Roma, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Junior Healthcare Consultant - Torino (Torino, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;div id=&quot;tor__fextListingLayout_readOnlyDiv&quot; class=&quot;richTextContent joqReqEditorReadOnlyDiv&quot;&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;tor__fextListingLayout_content&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation.&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- Il tuo ruolo e le tue responsabilità&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vuoi fare un lavoro che sia davvero significativo e di impatto? In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di aiutare i clienti, la società, le colleghe e i colleghi ad affrontare e risolvere le sfide più attuali e complesse. KPMG Advisory offre servizi di consulenza a organizzazioni pubbliche e private per accompagnarle nei percorsi di trasformazione dei modelli di business, miglioramento e digitalizzazione dei processi, analisi e gestione dei rischi, nonché nelle operazioni di finanza straordinaria.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribuisci alla digitalizzazione del Servizio Sanitario Nazionale (SSN)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Entrando a far parte del &lt;strong&gt;Team Healthcare di KPMG Advisory&lt;/strong&gt;, avrai l’opportunità di contribuire all’&lt;strong&gt;innovazione dei servizi&lt;/strong&gt; sanitari in Italia. Nei prossimi anni saremo impegnati nell’estensione dell’utilizzo degli strumenti digitali e delle trasformazioni che essi possono generare nelle strutture sanitarie e nella vita di oltre 60 milioni di persone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In particolare, supporterai gli enti del SSN nelle attività di:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;definizione delle strategie e valutazione dei relativi impatti sanitari, economici, finanziari e organizzativi;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;elaborazione delle strategie di trasformazione digitale e progettazione della relativa esperienza utente e paziente;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;valorizzazione delle tecnologie digitali per ripensare in modo innovativo servizi, processi e modelli operativi delle amministrazioni pubbliche e delle organizzazioni sanitarie;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;monitoraggio dello stato di avanzamento e dell’evoluzione dei servizi, dei sistemi e delle attività operative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sei pronto a contribuire al cambiamento del nostro Paese?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;La pandemia ha evidenziato ancora di più il ruolo strategico della sanità, un settore fondamentale non solo per la tutela della salute e della sicurezza dei cittadini, ma anche per la crescita e la resilienza economica del Paese.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In KPMG avrai l’opportunità di vivere il cambiamento in prima persona, lavorando a stretto contatto con professionisti del settore sanitario, dirigenti e manager del Servizio Sanitario Nazionale. Entrerai a far parte di un team giovane e dinamico, composto da professionisti che ogni giorno promuovono il cambiamento e l’innovazione, supportandoti nella tua crescita professionale attraverso formazione continua e affiancamento costante.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Siamo alla ricerca di professionisti per la nostra sede di &lt;strong&gt;Torino&lt;/strong&gt;, motivati a contribuire allo sviluppo del Paese. Cerchiamo persone empatiche, orientate al lavoro di squadra, al raggiungimento degli obiettivi e dotate di solide capacità di problem solving, entusiasmo e forte motivazione professionale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Le tue competenze e caratteristiche&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Il candidato ideale possiede:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;una laurea magistrale, conseguita con ottimi risultati, in discipline ingegneristiche (Ingegneria Biomedica, Ingegneria Gestionale), economiche (Economia Aziendale, Economia Sanitaria) o farmaceutiche (Chimica e Tecnologie Farmaceutiche, Biotecnologie Farmaceutiche);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;attitudine all’analisi quantitativa e padronanza degli strumenti di analisi dei dati (utilizzo avanzato di Excel, gestione di database, ecc.);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ottima conoscenza della lingua inglese, preferibilmente maturata anche attraverso esperienze di studio e/o lavoro all’estero;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ottima conoscenza del pacchetto Microsoft Office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - Cosa troverai in KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un ambiente di lavoro inclusivo ed equo, che rispetta, valorizza e promuove la diversità.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un contesto dinamico e sfidante, che incoraggia creatività, innovazione e lavoro di squadra.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modalità di lavoro ibride a supporto dell’equilibrio tra vita professionale e personale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Percorsi strutturati di formazione e sviluppo per una crescita continua.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un mindset internazionale e la possibilità di lavorare su progetti innovativi.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Iniziative dedicate al benessere psicofisico delle persone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;L’opportunità prevede un inserimento in stage con indennità mensile di 800€ per stage curriculare o 1.000€ per stage extracurriculare o in assunzione con inquadramento ai sensi del CCNL Commercio e RAL di ingresso: € 29.000, determinata sulla base di criteri oggettivi quali il titolo di studio e la valutazione del profilo rispetto ai requisiti della posizione. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In ottemperanza alla normativa vigente, non raccogliamo né utilizziamo informazioni sulle retribuzioni percepite in rapporti di lavoro attuali o precedenti. Le nostre procedure di selezione sono, inoltre, improntate a criteri oggettivi e neutrali rispetto al genere.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – I nostri valori e il nostro impegno&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership, lavoro in team, rispetto di ogni individualità, approfondimento continuo, trasparenza, impegno verso la comunità, integrità: questi sono i &lt;strong&gt;Valori di KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; che danno vita a un ambiente aperto allo scambio di idee e di conoscenza, che permette ai nostri professionisti di &lt;strong&gt;esprimere tutto il loro potenziale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Grazie all’impegno nel favorire un &lt;strong&gt;ambiente di lavoro inclusivo&lt;/strong&gt;, il nostro Network ha ottenuto le &lt;strong&gt;certificazioni ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt;, che attesta la conformità del Sistema di Gestione per la Diversità e l’Inclusione, e &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, che certifica la parità di genere. All’interno del nostro &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; -  &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt;  - trovi riassunte tutte le &lt;strong&gt;azioni concrete&lt;/strong&gt; che stiamo portando avanti su tematiche ambientali, sociali e di governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;). &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unisciti a noi!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;I tuoi dati saranno trattati nel pieno rispetto delle disposizioni del Regolamento (UE) n. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - &quot;GDPR&quot;) e successive modifiche. Per ulteriori informazioni, consultare l&apos;informativa sulla privacy di KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG S.p.A. garantisce le pari opportunità.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt; &lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;We let the future guide us. Join our next generation.&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your Role and Responsibilities.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Do you want to do work that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company, and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. KPMG Advisory offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitization, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help digitalise the national health system (NHS)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working with KPMG’s Healthcare team, you will have the opportunity to contribute to the innovation of healthcare services in Italy. &lt;strong&gt;Over the next few years, we will be working to expand the use of digital tools and the changes&lt;/strong&gt; they can bring to healthcare facilities and the lives of more than 60 million people.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With our team, you will assist NHS bodies: &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;outline the strategy and related healthcare, economic, financial and organisational impacts;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;prepare the digital strategy and related user and patient experience;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;leverage digital technologies to rethink, in an innovative way, service provided, processes and operating models of public and healthcare institutions;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;monitor the status and evolution of services, operating management and systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you ready to change the future of our country?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The pandemic shed additional light on the strategic importance of healthcare as a crucial sector not only for the health and safety of all citizens but for the country’s economic security as well.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With KPMG, you will see first hand where change happens, &lt;strong&gt;working closely with healthcare professionals and NHS officials and managers.&lt;/strong&gt; You will join a &lt;strong&gt;team of young colleagues and professionals &lt;/strong&gt;who work tirelessly day in and day out to promote and champion change, colleagues who will help you to grow and act as a point of reference and help plan your ongoing training.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are recruiting professionals for our office in&lt;strong&gt; Turin &lt;/strong&gt;who want to be part of setting the path for our country. Candidates must be empathetic and team players. They must be highly goal-oriented and have strong problem-solving abilities and they must be enthusiastic and strongly career-oriented.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Your Skills and Characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The successful candidate has:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;a master’s degree in engineering subjects (biomedical/engineering management), business (business/healthcare economics) or pharmaceutical subjects (chemistry and pharmaceutical technologies/pharmaceutical biotechnologies) with excellent results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;an aptitude for quantitative approaches and a mastery of data analysis tools (advanced use of Excel, database management, etc.);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;an excellent knowledge of English, preferably with study and/or work experience abroad;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;excellent knowledge of Microsoft Office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - What you&apos;ll find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An inclusive, equitable work environment that respects, encourages and values diversity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages creativity and teamwork&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced training and development programs to stay current&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International mindset and innovative projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initiatives focused on mental and physical well-being&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This opportunity is offered as either a paid internship offering a monthly allowance of €800 for curricular internships and €1,000 for extracurricular internships or a standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a starting gross annual salary of €29,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including educational qualifications and an assessment of the candidate’s profile against the requirements of the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better - Our Values and Commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect for each individuality, continuous deepening, transparency, commitment to the community, integrity: these are KPMG&apos;s Values that give rise to an environment open to the exchange of ideas and knowledge, which allows our professionals to express their full potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an inclusive work environment, our Network has obtained ISO 30415 certification, which certifies compliance of the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and UNI PdR 125, which certifies gender equality. Within our Impact Plan - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - you will find summarized all the concrete actions we are taking on environmental, social and governance (ESG) issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) No. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”) as amended. For more information, please see KPMG&apos;s privacy policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. guarantees equal opportunities.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-CA1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Torino-Junior-Healthcare-Consultant-Torino/1371191557/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1371191557</guid><g:id>1371191557</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Torino, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Deal Advisory Transaction Services Analyst | Padova (Padova, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;T&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:white&quot;&gt;he chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;- Your role and responsibilities &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. In keeping with the values of integrity and quality, &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Audit &amp;amp; Assurance&lt;/strong&gt; offers an integrated and constantly evolving portfolio of services, with insights that allow companies to respond to the informational/reporting needs of the market and investors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;The Transaction services team is part of Deal advisory, providing support in M&amp;amp;As, from the pre-deal evaluation to the post-deal integration or separation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Our professionals assist clients in identifying the risks and opportunities of their acquisitions, sales and joint ventures, helping them in transactions such as buy outs and IPOs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;When you join our team, you will be working closely with financial backers, shareholders and managers at all levels. You will assist clients in corporate finance transactions, availing of digital tools and using technology in your day-to-day activities. Our clients are large corporate entities and Italian and international private equity funds.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Join our team in &lt;strong&gt;Padua&lt;/strong&gt;: a dynamic and stimulating environment where you will work on &lt;strong&gt;financial due diligence&lt;/strong&gt; projects and provide assistance to our clients (Italian and international private equity funds and companies).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Come As &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;a master’s degree in business subjects (with a focus on accounting, management control and finance);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;1,5-2 years of experience in transaction services, audit, corporate finance or similar;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;accounting skills and knowledge of the financial reporting standards (Italian GAAP and IFRS);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;an ability to analyse financial statements and solid mathematical, financial and accounting expertise;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;a good knowledge of English;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a gross annual salary ranging from €29,000 to €33,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role. In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm 0.0cm 0.0cm 36.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:white;color:black&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;background-color:white;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-bottom:0.0cm&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt;, equitable &lt;strong&gt;work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;International&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-bottom:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;margin-top:0.0cm;margin-right:0.0cm;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:white&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality&lt;/span&gt;. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;u&gt;bit.ly/OurImpactPlanKPMG&lt;/u&gt; - you will find summarised all the &lt;strong&gt;concrete actions&lt;/strong&gt; we are taking on environmental, social and governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14.0pt;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;KPMG S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0.0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:black;background-color:white&quot;&gt;#LI-AV2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Padova-Deal-Advisory-Transaction-Services-Analyst-Padova/1371193657/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1371193657</guid><g:id>1371193657</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Deal advisory</g:job_function><g:location>Padova, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Senior Consultant F&amp;PM | Oracle | Torino (Torino, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do Work That Matters &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;- Your role and responsibilities &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Do you want to pursue a profession that is truly meaningful and impactful? At KPMG, you will have the opportunity to help clients, the company and colleagues address and solve the most current and complex challenges. &lt;strong&gt;KPMG Advisory &lt;/strong&gt;offers consulting services to companies to assist them in business model transformation, process improvement and digitisation, risk analysis and management, and support in extraordinary finance transactions.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, when you join our &lt;strong&gt;Financial management and enterprise performance management&lt;/strong&gt; team, you will have the opportunity to work on finance transformation projects, redesigning the control, planning and reporting models of leading companies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;You will join our rapidly-expanding team of young talents, which stands out for the quality and scope of its innovative projects, at our &lt;strong&gt;Turin/Milan&lt;/strong&gt; offices. You will work with colleagues that provide functional advice on corporate performance management systems, assisting clients in the analysis, review of designs and processes supporting the CFO and the subsequent development of technological platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Specifically, you will be tasked with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;redefining the &lt;strong&gt;business performance management strategies&lt;/strong&gt; for leading Italian and international companies, assisting the CFO in the redesign of the performance model;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;analysing and defining the new functional requirements of &lt;strong&gt;budgeting, forecasting, long-term planning, sales and operational planning and product costing&lt;/strong&gt; processes and implementing innovative performance management solutions;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;designing IT solutions for financial and business processes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt; and assisting during the implementation stage, working with the main EPM tool suppliers on the market (&lt;strong&gt;Oracle, Tagetik, Board&lt;/strong&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;implementing and configuring software solutions for consolidation, e.g., &lt;strong&gt;Oracle, FCCS, Narrative Reporting&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Account Reconciliation&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;maintaining extensive knowledge of the relevant accounting standards (US GAAP, IFRS, etc.) and ensuring compliance of consolidated financial statements;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;monitoring &lt;strong&gt;pre- and post-transformation performance&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;preparing functional analysis documents.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;vertical-align:baseline&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;have a master’s degree in &lt;strong&gt;Economics/STEM subjects&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;vertical-align:baseline&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;have &lt;strong&gt;2+ years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; in similar roles at a consulting company or firm;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;vertical-align:baseline&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;are familiar with the following: &lt;strong&gt;control models, budgeting and forecasting, consolidated and statutory financial statements and management accounts, financial planning&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;vertical-align:baseline&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;have an &lt;strong&gt;excellent knowledge of English&lt;/strong&gt;, preferably with study/work experience abroad;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;vertical-align:baseline&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;are familiar with &lt;strong&gt;Oracle EPM Cloud&lt;/strong&gt; (PBCS, FCCS, PCMCS, ARCS, Planning) and &lt;strong&gt;Oracle HFM&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Tagetik, OneStream&lt;/strong&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;vertical-align:baseline&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;are a problem solver, never lose sight of your goals, have strong interpersonal skills at work and as part of a team;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;vertical-align:baseline&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;Arial&amp;#39;, sans-serif&quot;&gt;have a desire to take on challenges and are comfortable in tough situations where leadership abilities can make the difference.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;inclusive&lt;/strong&gt; and equitable &lt;strong&gt;work environment&lt;/strong&gt; that respects, encourages and values &lt;strong&gt;diversity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;A challenging and dynamic environment that encourages&lt;strong&gt; creativity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;teamwork&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid&lt;/strong&gt; work arrangements to promote a healthy work-life balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong&gt;training&lt;/strong&gt; and development programmes to stay current&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Int_dxQRXY7F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Initiatives focused on &lt;strong&gt;mental and physical well-being&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Standard employment contract under the collective labour agreement for the commerce sector, with a starting gross annual salary ranging from €31,000 to €51,000. The salary is determined on the basis of objective criteria, including the candidate’s skills and experience assessed against the requirements of the role. In accordance with applicable legislation, we do not collect or use information relating to remuneration received in current or previous employment. Our selection procedures are based on objective and gender-neutral criteria. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Together for Better – Our values and commitment&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;Leadership, teamwork, respect every individual, continuous learning, transparency, commitment to the community and integrity. These are the &lt;strong&gt;KPMG&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;values &lt;/strong&gt;that create an environment that encourages the sharing of ideas and knowledge, so our professionals can &lt;strong&gt;achieve their full potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;As a result of our commitment to fostering an &lt;strong&gt;inclusive work&lt;/strong&gt; environment, our Network complies with the standards of the &lt;strong&gt;ISO 30415&lt;/strong&gt; requirements, on the Diversity and Inclusion Management System, and &lt;strong&gt;UNI PdR 125&lt;/strong&gt;, relating to gender equality. Within our &lt;strong&gt;Impact Plan&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;a href=&quot;https://kpmg.com/xx/en/about/our-impact-plan.html&quot;&gt;Our Impact Plan (kpmg.com)&lt;/a&gt; - you will find summarised all the &lt;strong&gt;concrete actions&lt;/strong&gt; we are taking on environmental, social and governance (&lt;strong&gt;ESG&lt;/strong&gt;) issues. &lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your data will be processed in full compliance with the provisions of Regulation (EU) no. 679/2016 (General Data Protection Regulation - “GDPR”), as amended. For more information, please see KPMG’s privacy policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;KPMG Advisory S.p.A. is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;#LI-LZ1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding:0.0px;text-indent:-0.5pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#ffffff&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding:0.0px;text-indent:-0.5pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;#39;72&amp;#39;, &amp;#39;72full&amp;#39;, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#ffffff&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;]]></description><link>https://careers.kpmg.it/job/Torino-Senior-Consultant-F&amp;PM-Oracle-Torino/1371224657/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">1371224657</guid><g:id>1371224657</g:id><g:expiration_date>2026-10-07</g:expiration_date><g:employer>KPMG Advisory Careers</g:employer><g:job_function>Management Consulting</g:job_function><g:location>Torino, IT</g:location></item><item><title>Experienced Accountant | Milano (Milano, IT)</title><description><![CDATA[&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;text-align:center&quot; align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:18.0pt;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:107%&quot;&gt;Experienced Accountant | Milano&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;text-align:center&quot; align=&quot;center&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The chance to build a better future is right in front of you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do Work That Matters - Your role and responsibilities&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPMG Fides Servizi di Amministrazione&lt;/strong&gt; provides professional services for administrative, accounting and tax processes. It plays a key role in redesigning reporting models and harmonising management accounting processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;KPMG Fides has over 300 professionals across six locations and continues to grow. As the Italian company of the KPMG network providing professional services for administrative, accounting and tax processes, KPMG Accounting supports leading Italian and international companies with administration, finance and control. It plays a key role in identifying potential opportunities, redesigning reporting models and harmonising management accounting processes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;In a context of profound digital transformation of accounting and administrative services, the Accounting team is increasingly involved in the evolution of operational processes, with the aim of improving efficiency, data quality and reliability, also through the growing use of digital tools and automated solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;At KPMG, we aim to invest in young people to equip them with the solid skills they need to become trusted, reliable professionals. By joining one of KPMG’s Accounting teams, you will work closely with leading companies, assisting them with an integrated compliance approach to administrative activities to translate the various legislative, regulatory and procedural requirements into accounting and tax processes. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;We are recruiting &lt;strong&gt;Senior Consultants&lt;/strong&gt; for our &lt;strong&gt;Milano &lt;/strong&gt;office to carry out administrative/accounting activities for our clients. Successful candidates will be involved in the following activities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;•    ordinary and cost accounting applying the Italian financial reporting standards and the IFRS, outsourced activities and accounting and administrative assistance; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;•    fulfilling clients’ tax requirements, preparing the main types of tax returns and forms, calculating taxes and analysing tax and statutory compliance;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;•    administrative and business process re-engineering/improvement; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;•    project/programme management for the design and implementation of IT and management systems;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;•    identifying and defining the requirements and the design of complex functional specifications;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;•    designing financial reporting models and tools. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Come As You Are - Your skills and characteristics&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;This is the perfect opportunity for you if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;•    a master’s degree in business;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;•    at least &lt;strong&gt;two/three years &lt;/strong&gt;of experience in the Administration, finance and control area;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;•    excellent knowledge of the &lt;strong&gt;Italian financial reporting standards&lt;/strong&gt; and the IFRS;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;•    excellent knowledge of general ledger and cost accounting methods and techniques;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;•    excellent knowledge of the main tax issues and related requirements:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;•    excellent knowledge of Microsoft Office (particularly Excel, PowerPoint, etc.);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;•    excellent knowledge of English, preferably with study and/or work experience abroad;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;•    excellent interpersonal and team working skills and a flexible and dynamic approach. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your Future With Us - What you’ll find at KPMG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
